OGM3OTdjZTM2Zjk3MmI0MjNlMzllODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1","sha":"edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1"}],"sha":"7063a52bb9abbe7428c797ce36f972b423e39e83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/7063a52bb9abbe7428c797ce36f972b423e39e83"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:45:48Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:45:48Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"message":"fix: smooth tab selection animation and remove background\n\nTab Navigation Improvements:\n- Remove light blue background from active tab (cleaner look)\n- Keep only orange (#EF7430) underline for active state\n- Fix jumping/stuttering animation when clicking tabs:\n  * Keep consistent padding on all tabs (var(--space-sm) 0)\n  * Add transparent border-bottom to inactive tabs (same height as active)\n  * Use margin-bottom: -3px consistently (prevents layout shift)\n  * Update transition to only animate color and border-color (not all)\n  * Border-bottom stays 3px on all tabs (changes color, not size)\n  * Change view-switch border from 2px to 3px for consistency\n\nResult:\n- Smooth, seamless tab transitions\n- No visual jumping or layout shift\n- Clean, minimal active state (orange underline only)\n- Better accessibility and visual clarity\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"60e9171672a2c76b937d2eeed98af4cce725e7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/trees/60e9171672a2c76b937d2eeed98af4cce725e7c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/commits/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1","node_id":"C_kwDOS1OGCtoAKGVkYWMwMjRjNDVhOTliNGM2MzI0ZGJiNDM3ZDNmYTQ0NGI0MGQ4YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/e36f82f6350dd0484b56e7db28d601d56bbea71e","sha":"e36f82f6350dd0484b56e7db28d601d56bbea71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/e36f82f6350dd0484b56e7db28d601d56bbea71e"}],"sha":"edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/edac024c45a99b4c6324dbb437d3fa444b40d8b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/e36f82f6350dd0484b56e7db28d601d56bbea71e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:43:23Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:43:23Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"message":"refactor: update colors to match README.md palette\n\nTab Navigation:\n- Active tab underline now uses orange (#EF7430) instead of blue\n- Maintains light blue background pill for visual prominence\n\nChart Colors:\n- Updated SCHOOL_TYPE_COLORS to match README.md specification:\n  - GS (Grundschule): #264D7F (primary blue)\n  - MS (Mittelschule): #EF7430 (orange)\n  - RS (Realschule): #49887A (teal)\n  - GY (Gymnasium): #264D7F (primary blue)\n  - IGS (Int. Gesamtschule): #EF7430 (orange)\n\nDesign Token Updates:\n- Chart color variables now reference the README palette\n- Ensures consistency across all visualizations\n\nColor Palette (from README.md):\n- Primary: #264D7F\n- Secondary: #EF7430 (orange)\n- Tertiary: #49887A (teal)\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@us