and user experience.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dfe14bcc8282a107f134c09e6cbcfedaf49d4a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/trees/dfe14bcc8282a107f134c09e6cbcfedaf49d4a43"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/commits/1e8f6de2e24ac100742ec3cdd00e631df33dba1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/1e8f6de2e24ac100742ec3cdd00e631df33dba1e","node_id":"C_kwDOS1OGCtoAKDFlOGY2ZGUyZTI0YWMxMDA3NDJlYzNjZGQwMGU2MzFkZjMzZGJhMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60","sha":"576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60"}],"sha":"1e8f6de2e24ac100742ec3cdd00e631df33dba1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/1e8f6de2e24ac100742ec3cdd00e631df33dba1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:37:30Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:37:30Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"message":"refactor: redesign to bycs.de design system (Phase 1)\n\n- Import Lexend (titles) and Atkinson Hyperlegible (body) fonts from Google Fonts\n- Update color palette to match bycs.de: #005ca9 primary blue, modernized grays\n- Add comprehensive design token system with spacing scale and semantic colors\n- Redesign typography scale: h1 (2.5rem), h2 (2rem), h3 (1.375rem)\n- Create primary/secondary button styles with hover and active states\n- Update card components with subtle shadows and lift on hover\n- Redesign header with sticky positioning and updated navigation tabs\n- Update hero sections with new layout and gradient background\n- Improve accessibility with 44px minimum touch targets and focus states\n- Add responsive breakpoints for tablet and mobile\n- Align all CSS variables and spacing to modern design tokens\n\nThis is a comprehensive visual refresh aligned with the bycs.de platform design language:\n- Government/education sector aesthetic\n- Emphasis on clarity and accessibility\n- Card-based content organization\n- Generous whitespace and professional typography\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a37c3aa54cbc0ea97613c72a9bc82f12b1cce22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/trees/0a37c3aa54cbc0ea97613c72a9bc82f12b1cce22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/git/commits/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60","node_id":"C_kwDOS1OGCtoAKDU3NmViYTBiM2QyNDNmNzc4YjAxOWViNDdlODAxYTRkODZhZDNhNjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commit/8d6b4efb3d87705489cccb79608887fc8db7dd14","sha":"8d6b4efb3d87705489cccb79608887fc8db7dd14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/8d6b4efb3d87705489cccb79608887fc8db7dd14"}],"sha":"576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/576eba0b3d243f778b019eb47e801a4d86ad3a60"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/edgar-treischl/mfe-bycs/commits/8d6b4efb3d87705489cccb79608887fc8db7dd14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T09:30:44Z","email":"edgar.treischl@isb.bayern.de","name":"edgar.treischl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"dat