-06-10T19:34:41Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"feat(cx): app OAuth2 ''User Agent'' scriptee par le seed (lfr-bff-card operationnelle)\n\nL''ERC n''est pas editable dans l''UI OAuth2 Administration et le type CX oAuthApplicationUserAgent est inconnu de la factory CETConfiguration en 2025.Q3 -> l''app est inseree en base par le seed (etape 6, idempotente), avec exactement ce que le JS Liferay.OAuth2Client attend (implementation extraite du jar com.liferay.oauth2.provider.web servi par le portail) : redirectURIs=/o/oauth2/redirect, homePageURL=BFF, client public AUTHORIZATION_CODE_PKCE, clientprofile=2 (USER_AGENT_APPLICATION, ordinal lu au javap dans l''enum ClientProfile), trustedApplication=true (flux iframe prompt=none sans consentement).\n\nSeed : ajout du mot de passe portail de testuser AVANT la correction des flags (le PATCH password reinitialise passwordReset/emailVerified - cause d''un 403 regressif corrige). Verifie : resolver /o/oauth2/application?externalReferenceCode=lfr-bff-card-oua -> 200 ; chemin A jwt-bearer avec le nouveau client -> users/me et content 200 ; negatifs /api/cx 401/401. RUNBOOK §9.b et TODO mis a jour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b5b64939dad6484731057ce12885fcf21c56cfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/8b5b64939dad6484731057ce12885fcf21c56cfb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/cd4a964c4101431f94c3a48f9386c9508aafc667","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","