thub.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/c6de5ceb80966c1d1b68089b8dc7ae9510927db1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:53:27Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:53:27Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"feat(liferay): migration DXP 2026.Q1 -> 2025.Q3.0 + mise a jour de toute la doc\n\nImage liferay/dxp:2025.q3.0 (compose + .env.example). Un downgrade Liferay etant impossible, la base liferay et le volume data ont ete reinitialises puis re-seedes par scripts/seed-liferay (testuser id=33437, contenu ''Bienvenue MFE'' id=33444, config Incoming Assertion regeneree). Le widget CX s''est re-enregistre automatiquement au boot (configs OSGi montees). Shell rebuilde avec demoContentId=33444.\n\nDocs mises a jour partout (README, ARCHITECTURE, DATA-FLOW, RUNBOOK, TODO, liferay-setup, scripts, commentaires code) : version de la stack -> 2025.Q3.0 ; les mentions du bug jwt-bearer restent datees ''observe sur DXP 2026.Q1'' (l''approche config systeme est validee sur les deux versions) ; exemples de payloads ré-alignes (sub=email, 2 audiences, nouveaux ids). Verifie E2E sur 2025.Q3 : users/me + content 200, CX main.js 200, 7 conteneurs.\n\nReste manuel : recreer le client OAuth2 (RUNBOOK §3 etape 4) pour repasser de LIFERAY_AUTH_MODE=admin a jwt-bearer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a94b5b0024616c80ca5906ecc7e2c89f5b68ef5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/5a94b5b0024616c80ca5906ecc7e2c89f5b68ef5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/c6de5ceb80966c1d1b68089b8dc7ae9510927db1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/c6de5ceb80966c1d1b68089b8dc7ae9510927db1","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKGM2ZGU1Y2ViODA5NjZjMWQxYjY4MDg5YjhkYzdhZTk1MTA5MjdkYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed","sha":"d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed"}],"sha":"c6de5ceb80966c1d1b68089b8dc7ae9510927db1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/c6de5ceb80966c1d1b68089b8dc7ae9510927db1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:19:42Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:19:42Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"docs(architecture): schemas detailles des 2 chemins + echanges de jetons couche par couche\n\n§4 refondu (chemin A - MFE) : diagramme de sequence complet annote avec ce qui est echange ET verifie a chaque saut (PKCE, signature RS256/JWKS, iss/aud/sub, echange jwt-bearer RFC 7523, token Liferay at+jwt, cache par user) + tableau des claims decisifs. Corrige les passages obsoletes (Instance Settings/JWKS par URL -> config OSGi systeme/JWKS litteral).\n\n§6 bis (chemin B - client extension) : schema architectural complet (rendu de page, portlet CET, ressources statiques, session+CSRF), explication JSESSIONID/Liferay.authToken (aucun jeton OIDC), tableau comparatif des 2 chemins. Nouveau §6 ter : inventaire des jetons/cles/secrets (emetteur, detenteur, verificateur, duree de vie) + lecture de surete. Structure du depot mise a jour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43e7da518329418c8554580fbc8023c92021d728","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/43e7da518329418c8554580fbc8023c92021d728"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKGQyYjlkZjIyYjE4YmYxOTEzN2M0MzIyMWY5NzRiM2VhNDg4NDliZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0","sha":"6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0"}],"sha":"d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/d2b9df22b18bf19137c43221f974b3ea48849bed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:07:57Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T10:07:57Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"fix(cx): enregistrement du widget via config OSGi CETConfiguration\n\nSur self-hosted DXP 2026.Q1, le *.client-extension-config.json du zip ne cree PAS l''entree CET (le zip ne fait que servir les ressources statiques). L''enregistrement du widget passe par une config OSGi factory CETConfiguration~lfr-user-card.config (baseURL, type customElement, typeSettings, dxp.lxc.liferay.com.virtualInstanceId=liferay.com) deposee dans osgi/configs - meme mecanisme que l''Incoming Assertion. Verifie : portlet ClientExtensionEntryPortlet_..._LXC_lfr_user_card actif -> widget visible dans l''editeur (categorie Client Extensions). RUNBOOK/TODO mis a jour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3da3d62140e9eb075b1d22af15cae108de3df57b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/3da3d62140e9eb075b1d22af15cae108de3df57b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDY3OTY2ODlkYjlhNDU2NjFhYTc5YjRlMmFiODE1YmRmMTNjN2U5YTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388","sha":"cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388"}],"sha":"6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/6796689db9a45661aa79b4e2ab815bdf13c7e9a0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:55:18Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:55:18Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"feat(cx): client extension Angular ''User Card'' (custom element in-portal)\n\nCustom element <lfr-user-card> (Angular 21 + @angular/elements, zoneless, builder standard) affichant les coordonnees de l''utilisateur de la session Liferay : my-user-account avec cookie + x-csrf-token=Liferay.authToken (ni Keycloak ni BFF pour ce cas). Deploye comme widget sur une page (categorie Client Extensions de l''editeur).\n\nPackaging LUFFA : *.client-extension-config.json (descripteur JSON, typeSettings) + WEB-INF/liferay-plugin-package.properties + static/. Scripts build-client-extension.ps1/.sh : zip cree en .NET avec separateurs ''/'' (Compress-Archive ecrit des ''\\\\'' -> moduleId is not correct), depose dans liferay/client-extensions/ monte sur osgi/client-extensions (hot deploy + persistant). Pieges documentes (RUNBOOK §9) : deploy/ consomme le zip sans l''enregistrer ; outputHashing=none pour des noms stables.\n\nVerifie : bundle STARTED, /o/lfr-user-card/main.js et styles.css -> 200, aucune regression (BFF jwt-bearer 200/200, 7 conteneurs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1bae3558f149d65f66dde8e6d85ab29b5961e78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/d1bae3558f149d65f66dde8e6d85ab29b5961e78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKGNjNGQzZDAwYjAzMjgzYmE3ZDc0OWNiYmNhMDcyYjEyNGQ0YTEzODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890","sha":"7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890"}],"sha":"cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/cc4d3d00b03283ba7d749cbbca072b124d4a1388"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:30:30Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:30:30Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"docs: le champ JWKS de l''Incoming Assertion n''accepte pas d''URL (teste en live)\n\nRUNBOOK §8 : 2 pieges ajoutes - (1) URL JWKS non supportee (Liferay parse la valeur comme du JSON, JwkUtils.readJwkSet echoue ; le rejet passe inapercu car l''ancienne config reste en memoire jusqu''au restart) ; (2) invalid_grant apres rotation/reimport des cles Keycloak -> relancer le seed (JWKS statique). DATA-FLOW §6 : note correspondante sur le format du champ.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a90d50d06f170ed08de5fde27cd944a80289088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/6a90d50d06f170ed08de5fde27cd944a80289088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDdlZWM5N2EyNzhlMzU0NGU2ZmJiNTY2MzVmY2EyOThkMzUwYWM4OTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f","sha":"0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f"}],"sha":"7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/7eec97a278e3544e6fbb56635fca298d350ac890"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:09:37Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T09:09:37Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"fix(compose): config OSGi jwt-bearer persistante (montage /mnt/liferay/files)\n\nLa config Incoming Assertion deposee par docker cp vivait dans la couche du conteneur et disparaissait a chaque re-creation (docker compose down -> No JWS signature keys au boot suivant). Montage de ./liferay/osgi-config sur /mnt/liferay/files/osgi/configs : l''entrypoint officiel la copie dans /opt/liferay/osgi/configs au boot, sans ecraser les configs existantes. Verifie : down/up -> jwt-bearer operationnel sans intervention.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fdf4e443c87ca991bbdbec2df96ed51773be86a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/7fdf4e443c87ca991bbdbec2df96ed51773be86a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDAwNDUyNTZlNTI3MThjMzNjNjQ5MzI4YTg5ZmIzN2RhZjM0NmJjMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6","sha":"55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6"}],"sha":"0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/0045256e52718c33c649328a89fb37daf346bc1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T08:45:16Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T08:45:16Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"fix(docker): build du shell qui ne se termine jamais + hotes valides Liferay\n\nfrontend/Dockerfile : le builder Native Federation du shell ne rend pas la main apres ''bundle generation complete'' (process ng zombie -> docker build infini). Contournement : build en arriere-plan, detection du marqueur ''Output location'', kill, puis validation des artefacts (index.html + remoteEntry.json) qui fait foi.\n\nportal-ext : virtual.hosts.valid.hosts inclut ''liferay'' — le ValidHostNameFilter de DXP 2026.Q1 repondait 500 ''Invalid host name liferay'' aux appels du BFF conteneur (echange jwt-bearer via liferay:8080). RUNBOOK : 2 pieges ajoutes.\n\nVerifie : stack 100% conteneurisee (7 conteneurs), fronts nginx 200, BFF conteneur en jwt-bearer -> /api/users/me et /api/content 200.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"780b7dfd9fb9e645b1cfd97c03dbe91efa9612df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/780b7dfd9fb9e645b1cfd97c03dbe91efa9612df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDU1ZDI2MDJkMWJmOTA2MDNjN2U4YzUyNmI5NjZkNDRhNDU2YWMwYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/5c0c5a97b3c6b85a3d4916d8d512c2ebd57dea98","sha":"5c0c5a97b3c6b85a3d4916d8d512c2ebd57dea98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/5c0c5a97b3c6b85a3d4916d8d512c2ebd57dea98"}],"sha":"55d2602d1bf90603c7e8c526b966d44a456ac0b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/55d2602d1