users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commits/06c585a3905f5d4325cb773bddca89e74226585e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:33:40Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T22:33:40Z","email":"m.badr.hamami@gmail.com","name":"HAMAMI Mohamed"},"message":"feat(auth): flux jwt-bearer PAR UTILISATEUR operationnel (bug DXP contourne)\n\nLe BFF echange desormais le token Keycloak contre un token Liferay par user (LIFERAY_AUTH_MODE=jwt-bearer par defaut) ; les appels headless s''executent avec les permissions reelles de l''utilisateur et le BFF ne detient plus d''identifiants admin.\n\n3 deblocages issus de la recherche : (1) config ''OAuth 2 Incoming Assertion'' au niveau SYSTEME via fichier OSGi deploye a chaud dans /opt/liferay/osgi/configs (le niveau Instance Settings est ignore par un bug DXP 2026.Q1 ; meme approche que les tests fonctionnels Liferay) ; (2) mapper Keycloak sub-as-email sur le client shell-web (Liferay mappe l''utilisateur via le claim sub, access token uniquement) ; (3) flags de compte corriges par le seed (agreedToTermsOfUse/passwordReset/emailVerified -> sinon 403 silencieux) + contenu viewableBy=Anyone (sinon 404 pour non-admin).\n\nSeed scripts etendus (5 etapes, idempotents, JSON-WS pour invalider le cache d''entites), realm export enrichi (sub-as-email), docs mises a jour (DATA-FLOW §6, ARCHITECTURE, TODO, scripts/README). Verifie de bout en bout : /api/users/me et /api/content/34379 -> 200 avec token par user.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"528a6096b2b4209858dcf51900e159160bd20965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/528a6096b2b4209858dcf51900e159160bd20965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/06c585a3905f5d4325cb773bddca89e74226585e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/06c585a3905f5d4325cb773bddca89e74226585e","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDA2YzU4NWEzOTA1ZjVkNDMyNWNiNzczYmRkY2E4OWU3NDIyNjU4NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/5a7d170c5736796e0d4bc78eaeb6272def0b4bc7","sha"