boot a froid). .env.example: ADMIN_PASSWORD=test (defaut Liferay reel) + LIFERAY_AUTH_MODE.\n\nscripts/seed-liferay.ps1 + .sh (idempotents) : creent testuser + contenu web via headless, rejouent la partie donnees de la Phase 2 sans clic. Testes (detectent l''existant, pas de doublon). + scripts/README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e2cfbbe153622e32ac0f132ff4ba98a2da69f87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/4e2cfbbe153622e32ac0f132ff4ba98a2da69f87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/5a7d170c5736796e0d4bc78eaeb6272def0b4bc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/5a7d170c5736796e0d4bc78eaeb6272def0b4bc7","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDVhN2QxNzBjNTczNjc5NmUwZDRiYzc4ZWFlYjYyNzJkZWYwYjRiYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/ca00a06822c3eaaafb56c64aedefc510e70a4549","sha":"ca00a0