e les memes donnees du user (lookup par email) ; le code jwt-bearer reste le mode par defaut.\n\nDocs: nouveau docs/DATA-FLOW.md (transit detaille couche par couche, payloads reels). ARCHITECTURE.md aligne sur la realite (Angular CLI 21, repli admin, callout du bug). TODO.md: phases 2-6 OK, critere de succes atteint. Shell: demoContentId=34379.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9dfbf6e57484acb41e8610d3aaccf22b94be667","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/e9dfbf6e57484acb41e8610d3aaccf22b94be667"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/ca00a06822c3eaaafb56c64aedefc510e70a4549","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/ca00a06822c3eaaafb56c64aedefc510e70a4549","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKGNhMDBhMDY4MjJjM2VhYWFmYjU2YzY0YWVkZWZjNTEwZTcwYTQ1NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/d38bdf992081079