/api/content/{id}). Le shell fournit auth + HttpClient ; les MFE charges utilisent ces singletons partages (Native Federation). Dockerfile parametre (build PROJECT -> nginx + CORS) et services shell/mfe-user/mfe-content dans compose (4200/4201/4202).\n\nVerifie : les 3 apps buildent (ng build) ; servies + BFF, /api/whoami -> 200, MFE charges via remoteEntry.json. Donnees user/contenu en attente de Liferay.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0929c90c843a9dce55fe03da5456e6e58ab2a84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/0929c90c843a9dce55fe03da5456e6e58ab2a84f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/d38bdf9920810799b04ebad5ba012584a8165cf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/d38bdf9920810799b04ebad5ba012584a8165cf4","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKGQzOGJkZjk5MjA4MTA3OTliMDRlYmFkNWJhMDEyNTg0YTgxNjVjZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":