 LiferayHeadlessClient (RestClient), UserController (/api/users/me, /api/whoami), ContentController (/api/content/{id}), DTO + handler d''erreurs. Dockerfile multi-stage (+curl) et service bff dans compose (localhost:8082).\n\nVerifie en live : mvn package OK ; /api/whoami -> 401 sans token, 200 + identite avec token Keycloak (JWKS + issuer valides). users/me & content : en attente de Liferay (Phase 2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff175261840bc1bf5f74ccf95ac649182c49ec8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/trees/ff175261840bc1bf5f74ccf95ac649182c49ec8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/git/commits/5648771268749243d8813b4383c0c6597d953240","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/169982773?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami","id":169982773,"login":"mbhamami","node_id":"U_kgDOCiG7NQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mbhamami","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mbhamami/liferay-mfe/commit/5648771268749243d8813b4383c0c6597d953240","node_id":"C_kwDOS1QwUtoAKDU2NDg3NzEyNjg3NDkyNDNkODgxM2I0MzgzYzBjNjU5N2Q5NTMyNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"ht