ttps://claude.ai/code/session_016rdSj8ihsyekGDAXZHZVAE","tree":{"sha":"b6665c1d015c918f6d0eba23ad437bbe1c6a308b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/trees/b6665c1d015c918f6d0eba23ad437bbe1c6a308b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/commits/aba42462823a517945ed14ba4bfc0e9a5ad3201e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6651455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole","id":6651455,"login":"gnueole","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTE0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole/improv-assist/commit/aba42462823a517945ed14ba4bfc0e9a5ad3201e","node_id":"C_kwDOS1X599oAKGFiYTQyNDYyODIzYTUxNzk0NWVkMTRiYTRiZmMwZTlhNWFkMzIwMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole/improv-assist/commit/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04","sha":"888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04"}],"sha":"aba42462823a517945ed14ba4bfc0e9a5ad3201e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/aba42462823a517945ed14ba4bfc0e9a5ad3201e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6651455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole","id":6651455,"login":"gnueole","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTE0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:05:02Z","email":"hi@eole.me","name":"gnueole"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:05:02Z","email":"hi@eole.me","name":"gnueole"},"message":"feat(telemetry): post to Vector, decommission the Notion path\n\nTelemetry reached a Notion database through an n8n workflow. Notion is not a\ntime-series store — jobby alone wrote ~80 rows a day before it stopped — and all\nthree receiving workflows carried the same defect: the Notion node read\n$json.body while its input was a data-table node''s output, which has no body.\nimprov''s failed on every event, 66 runs for 66 failures; the other two had never\nbeen exercised and would have failed on their first.\n\nEvents now go to http://vector:8080, which ships to the Axiom eole-telemetry\ndataset, tagged with an `application` field so the dashboards can group by\nproject. That makes the defect moot rather than worth fixing, and the three\nworkflows are quarantined.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016rdSj8ihsyekGDAXZHZVAE","tree":{"sha":"4b162c9c33cb850094ea3c5f61b035d47a565c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/trees/4b162c9c33cb850094ea3c5f61b035d47a565c17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/commits/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6651455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole","id":6651455,"login":"gnueole","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTE0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole/improv-assist/commit/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04","node_id":"C_kwDOS1X599oAKDg4ODI3MWExMmQ0NzcwNzg1NDRkMjExODI3YTJjN2Q0NzFjZTBhMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole/improv-assist/commit/961554bc96c4d8bb66536f4145b08b803138953d","sha":"961554bc96c4d8bb66536f4145b08b803138953d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/961554bc96c4d8bb66536f4145b08b803138953d"}],"sha":"888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/888271a12d477078544d211827a2c7d471ce0a04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6651455?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnueole","id":6651455,"login":"gnueole","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NTE0NTU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnueole","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/commits/961554bc96c4d8bb66536f4145b08b803138953d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:02:20Z","email":"hi@eole.me","name":"gnueole"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T12:02:20Z","email":"hi@eole.me","name":"gnueole"},"message":"chore(n8n): realign the exported workflows with the instance\n\nRenames and the error-handler wiring landed on the instance today. push_all\nmatches local files by workflow name, so a stale export would have recreated the\npre-rename workflows on the next push.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016rdSj8ihsyekGDAXZHZVAE","tree":{"sha":"37b8f66ff3fc77c40e3cf383999ddcffa9ccb839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/trees/37b8f66ff3fc77c40e3cf383999ddcffa9ccb839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gnueole/improv-assist/git/commits/961554bc96c4d8bb66536f4145b08