/api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/84259b8645485ad033059555720a7cbea6a34c4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T12:52:54Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T12:52:54Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Emulator: visualize per-model cooldown on the score bars\n\nEach live score bar now shows three states: green (idle/below threshold), amber\n(firing this frame), and a hatched-slate refractory state while the model is in\nits 2 s cooldown and can''t re-trigger. During cooldown the bar is repurposed as a\ncountdown — full when the model just fired, draining to empty as the window\nexpires — so there''s persistent \"blocked\" feedback even after the live score has\ndropped back to ~0. The score number keeps showing the live score.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"108a234e6bf04176664fc55f31ec54be73b933d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/108a234e6bf04176664fc55f31ec54be73b933d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/84259b8645485ad033059555720a7cbea6a34c4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/84259b8645485ad033059555720a7cbea6a34c4f","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDg0MjU5Yjg2NDU0ODVhZDAzMzA1OTU1NTcyMGE3Y2JlYTZhMzRjNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab","sha":"f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab"}],"sha":"84259b8645485ad033059555720a7cbea6a34c4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/84259b8645485ad033059555720a7cbea6a34c4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T12:37:53Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T12:37:53Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Emulator: run all models at once with per-model log table\n\nRefactor from a single active model to a per-model ModelCtx and run every model in\nthe library simultaneously in all tabs, for direct baseline-vs-distill comparison:\n\n- ModelCtx owns all per-model state (tflite handle, input/output quant, streaming\n  accumulator, peak window, refractory cooldown, DOM refs). The MicroFrontend runs\n  once per frame; all models share the raw features (1× frontend + N× MixedNet).\n- Live mic: one compact score column per model (~6 fit across). Detection log is a\n  fixed-column table — model names in the header once, one row per event with every\n  model''s score aligned under its column; firing models highlighted, over-threshold-\n  but-cooling in amber, below-threshold dim.\n- Per-model cooldown: each model has its own 2 s refractory window, so one model\n  firing never suppresses another''s detection (fixes buenas_noches being swallowed\n  by a recent chispa detection).\n- Test WAV: per-model results table (peak / peak-time / detected) + teacher row.\n- Scan dir: one peak column per model with per-model detection counts (teacher\n  skipped in bulk scan — too slow).\n- Remove model selection entirely: the threshold slider is global and a detection is\n  any model crossing it, so a \"primary\" model changed nothing. Library list is\n  view/remove only.\n- Mark the teacher as a distinct model type: dashed teal divider + label\n  \"openWakeWord · reference, not deployed\"; tagged in the WAV table and log column.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f365064a9edad2c52623870f2f7ec29f939b9f86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/f365064a9edad2c52623870f2f7ec29f939b9f86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKGY5ZThjZjJjNWRiMDE1YjVmOTExYjVhMmMyOTUwYWFjYjg1YzI4YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6","sha":"9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6"}],"sha":"f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/f9e8cf2c5db015b5f911b5a2c2950aacb85c28ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:16:52Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:16:52Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Distillation pipeline + target-language speech negatives\n\nAdd optional openWakeWord-style teacher distillation (off by default; see\nDISTILLATION.md) and target-language speech negatives, all running in the same\ntrain/venv:\n\n- train/train_teacher.py + teacher_infer.py: train the teacher head on Piper\n  positives vs local negatives, export 3 ONNX files; shared Teacher runtime used\n  by the scorer and the browser emulator.\n- train.py --distill/--teacher_model/--distill_weight: score augmented clips\n  into <split>/teacher_scores.npy and blend soft labels (lambda=0 is a no-op).\n- Speech negatives: tools/gen_piper_negatives.py (Piper confusables) and\n  tools/fetch_speech.py (FLEURS+VoxPopuli via soundfile, no torchcodec). Feed\n  both the teacher (run.sh --negatives_dirs) and the student\n  (train.py --student_neg_audio_dirs/--student_neg_weight).\n- microwakeword patches: clip_scorer callback in spectrograms.py, return_soft +\n  teacher_scores.npy loading in data.py, soft-label blend in train.py, and the\n  shared 16 kHz loader (audio_io.py) for clips.py to keep student/teacher aligned.\n- run.sh (renamed from onoff.sh): wire DISTILL/STUDENT_NEG/LANG_CODE; split\n  firmware/requirements.txt (ESPHome+Ruff) from train/requirements.txt; retrained\n  turn_on/turn_off tflites; trainer Test-tab tweaks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2bb8caa94d5beaf612f93bf233414ec56f43f5dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/2bb8caa94d5beaf612f93bf233414ec56f43f5dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDkxMjNjNWU1Y2Y0MTE0MjNkYmZkNjhkNWUzNjY4YTJhNWM4NjdhYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/f45ffcf8b0718ecc2dcadaa1891c50eaae13e389","sha":"f45ffcf8b0718ecc2dcadaa1891c50eaae13e389","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/f45ffcf8b0718ecc2dcadaa1891c50eaae13e389"}],"sha":"9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/9123c5e5cf411423dbfd68d5e3668a2a5c867ab6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/f45ffcf8b0718ecc2dcadaa1891c50eaae13e389/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:12:54Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T11:12:54Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Emulator: live teacher A/B eval + simplify output scaling\n\nAdd the B5a/B5b browser eval to docs/emulator: load the openWakeWord-style\nteacher (3 ONNX files from train_teacher.py) and score it live alongside the\nstudent in a dual student/teacher column, plus a clip bank that captures live\nmic audio (manual or auto-on-detection) for building an eval set, persisted in\nIndexedDB with per-clip student/teacher peaks and WAV download. Wires in the\nshared docs/common/teacher.js runtime.\n\nReplace the old silence-probe output-scaling guess with a deterministic rule\nkeyed off the output tensor dtype: FLOAT32 -> OUT_SCALE 1.0 (tf-tflite returns\nthe sigmoid float directly, for the legacy float-export dev models), quantized\n-> the tensor''s own dequant scale (1/256 for every uint8 model we ship, which\ntf-tflite hands back as raw ints). The probe couldn''t distinguish a raw int 0\nfrom a float 0.0 on silence, so it left OUT_SCALE at 1.0 and the live mic-score\ndisplayed unscaled 0..255; the stale 5-frame peak window then emitted phantom\ndetections. Both gone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3573cc3f3804c4e5b2558e4c50c9a36f43f2755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/c3573cc3f3804c4e5b2558e4c50c9a36f43f2755"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/f45ffcf8b0718ecc2dcadaa1891c50eaae13e389","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use