ail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Fix web trainer: es-419 dict 404, spectrogram stack overflow, single voice picker\n\n- lang_loader.js: check WASM FS first (piper_phonemize.data embeds all langs);\n  fetch fallback maps variant codes to shared base dicts (es-419 -> es_dict,\n  hyw -> hy, ltg -> lv, nb -> no)\n- spectrogram.js: heap-allocate PCM for frontend_process; ccall ''array'' uses\n  stackAlloc which overflows on long clips\n- Single multi-select voice picker (.onnx + .onnx.json) that auto-loads when\n  both files are present, with missing-file feedback; Load button removed\n- piper_worker.js: use ort.webgpu.min.js bundle so WebGPU is actually\n  available; request it only when navigator.gpu exists\n- Update stale test expectations (interleaved PADs, uint16 feature range)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bdac9536f4e377ae46011f94cbea74941784768","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/7bdac9536f4e377ae46011f94cbea74941784768"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/edbccef17d4e9065314257c749df398f8e5acd93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owne