,"email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Add LICENSE.md (MIT + third-party inventory) and license texts\n\nOriginal code is MIT. LICENSE.md also inventories every vendored component\nand its license — notably GPL-3.0 for espeak-ng (sources + the voice data\nserved by the Pages trainer, plus the piper_phonemize.wasm that links it)\nand for the vendored ESPHome C++ micro_wake_word component — with a summary\nof redistribution obligations. Canonical GPL-3.0 and Apache-2.0 texts in\nlicenses/ (the vendored copies had been stripped of their license files).\n\nAlso: trainer UI now explains where negatives.mwwn comes from (HuggingFace\nkahrendt/microwakeword via train.py''s first run) and how to build/host it;\nPages landing footer links the license inventory; README License section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d77eba964ce87d94701122408a329077cb60b4e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/d77eba964ce87d94701122408a329077cb60b4e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/8d8a0543099603081959575baf71abb53caf72fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/8d8a0543099603081959575baf71abb53caf72fe","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDhkOGEwNTQzMDk5NjAzMDgxOTU5NTc1YmFmNzFhYmI1M2NhZjcyZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b","sha":"7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b"}],"sha":"8d8a0543099603081959575baf71abb53caf72fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/8d8a0543099603081959575baf71abb53caf72fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:25:13Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T11:25:13Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Restructure GitHub Pages: landing page + emulator/ + trainer/ + shared common/\n\nServe both browser tools from Pages (main:/docs, plain static — no Actions):\n  /          landing page linking to both tools (docs/index.html, new)\n  /emulator/ browser wake-word tester (moved from docs/ root)\n  /trainer/  browser trainer (git mv from web_trainer/www/ — the trainer needs\n             HTTPS for microphone access, which Pages provides)\n  /common/   web_trainer.js/.wasm shared by both pages (the two copies were\n             byte-identical; CMake now copies wasm builds here)\n\n- train_worker.js: explicit locateFile — in a worker Emscripten resolves the\n  .wasm against the worker''s URL (js/), not the imported script''s location\n- CMakeLists: WWW_DIR -> ../docs/trainer, wasm outputs -> ../docs/common\n- playwright: serve docs/ as root, test URLs prefixed /trainer/; fix absolute\n  /tflite_template.bin fetch in trainer.spec.js\n- .gitignore: negatives.mwwn/noise.mwwb rules moved to docs/.gitignore\n- docs/.nojekyll added; READMEs updated to the new URLs/paths\n\nVerified: playwright 103 passed (3 failures pre-date the move: ipaToIds x2,\naudioToFloat32Spec); all site paths smoke-checked with a local static server.\nnegatives.mwwn stays out of git — on Pages use the trainer''s load-from-disk\ninput or a GitHub Release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"17e45c1232439a509596e3869b24162ccb03adff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/17e45c1232439a509596e3869b24162ccb03adff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDdkZjk4YmM5ODQ1M2IxZTA5YTg2ZjgwOWVkY2I1ZGFlN2I0MDhkMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18","sha":"4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18"}],"sha":"7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/7df98bc98453b1e09a86f809edcb5dae7b408d0b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:00:02Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T15:00:02Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Fix ESP32-S3 I2S slot_mask bug: mono RX read both slots, feeding 2x-slow audio to mww\n\nRoot cause of \"weak/zero detection\" in aivox3-game: on ESP32-S3,\nI2S_STD_PHILIPS_SLOT_DEFAULT_CONFIG leaves slot_mask at SLOT_BOTH even in\nMONO mode (the classic-ESP32 variant selects LEFT). The ES8311 mirrors its\nmono ADC onto both stereo slots, so full_duplex_audio captured every sample\ntwice -> speech stretched 2x, an octave down -> near-zero model\nprobabilities while mic levels looked healthy. Force I2S_STD_SLOT_LEFT,\nlike the stock i2s_audio microphone does for channel: left.\n\n- full_duplex_audio: add dump_pcm_b64() serial-log audio dump (debug what\n  mww hears with no network) + tools/decode_pcm_log.py + tools/clip_server.py\n- aivox3-game.yaml: model probability_cutoff 0.99 — engine-internal\n  detections call reset_probabilities() (ignore_windows_=-100), leaving the\n  game deaf ~1s after every warm attempt; the game polls raw probabilities\n  and owns all win logic, so the engine cutoff must never fire\n- game_display: retune tiers for clean audio (WIN 0.45, bands 0.12/0.22/0.35),\n  \"getting warmer\" streak bonus (+0.04 per caliente attempt, cap 0.12, reset\n  on win or 15s idle), peak-hold bar (hold 1.2s then decay), fix cooldown\n  ordering (fanfare could play during cooldown without on_win_ running)\n- aivox3.yaml: restore Spanish manifests after alexa/okay_nabu A/B test\n- models: 2-voice retrain of chispa magica / buenas noches — validated on\n  aivox3.yaml (max prob 1.00); the \"bad retrain\" verdict was actually the\n  slot bug. onoff.sh: matching params (2 voices, neg_class_weight 22)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"440dab1d1458bba39cbfae6ff0614dd6f4fc9931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/440dab1d1458bba39cbfae6ff0614dd6f4fc9931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/4d46740d1a23ce2e9bc4c7774e726a1c1670cf18","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDRkNDY3NDBkMWEyM2NlMmU5YmM0Yzc3NzRlNzI2YTFjMTY3MGNmMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/3ef3bbe2c91e916f8b989e1c556f6ee3f6111a84","sha":"3ef3bbe2c91e