"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/5b7fba3ae87783109af6aa8474f9ddf18a07ece7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:26:20Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T16:26:20Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Add AI-VOX3 game firmware with custom components\n\n- aivox3-game.yaml: frío/tibio/caliente hot-cold game; two thermometers on\n  the LCD (wake-word probability + mic amplitude), tone feedback per tier,\n  relay toggle on WIN; WiFi and ALC disabled pending further tuning\n- components/full_duplex_audio: custom full-duplex I2S component for\n  simultaneous mic capture and speaker tone playback; mic level monitor,\n  software gain knob, PSRAM clip upload\n- components/micro_wake_word: patched to expose sliding-average probability\n  via get_peak_and_reset() per model; probability passed to on_wake_word_detected\n- components/game_display: Core 0 FreeRTOS task driving LCD thermometers,\n  LED colour, tones, and relay; peak-hold decay avoids polling-race flicker\n- tools/sample_server.py: HTTP endpoint for receiving WAV clip uploads\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf0334882673fea51f4c0be03dd7e7ce91d498b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/cf0334882673fea51f4c0be03dd7e7ce91d498b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/re