MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/9e9429e5f0878059984e2d638c136d85691deccd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:25:46Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T15:25:46Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Add web_trainer milestone 5: augmentation pipeline + full Playwright test suite\n\nwww/js/augment.js — pure-JS augmentation library:\n  - loadWav: parse WAV ArrayBuffer (16-bit PCM / 32-bit float)\n  - pitchShift: linear resampling (±semitones)\n  - applyParametricEQ: 7-band peaking biquad EQ, RBJ cookbook coefficients\n  - convolve: radix-2 Cooley-Tukey FFT convolution (Float64 internally)\n  - applyReverb: convolve + normalize + trim to original length\n  - mixNoise: SNR-based background noise mixing\n  - augmentSample: stochastic pipeline matching train/microwakeword/audio/augmentation.py\n  - fetchImpulseResponses: fetch all 8 bundled room IRs from www/impulses/\n\nwww/impulses/ — 8 room impulse responses from piper_sample_generator/impulses/\nwww/test_wasm.html — minimal harness that loads web_trainer.js and sets webTrainerReady\nCMakeLists.txt — POST_BUILD step copies web_trainer.js/.wasm to www/\n\nTests grow from 8 → 34 (all passing):\n  tests/augment.spec.js  — 11 tests: loadWav, pitchShift, gain, convolve, reverb, noise, augmentSample\n  tests/frontend.spec.js —  4 tests: MicroFrontend WASM (milestone 1)\n  tests/mixednet.spec.js —  7 tests: MixedNet forward, train_step loss decay, param round-trip (milestones 2-3)\n  tests/phonemize.spec.js — 8 tests: espeak-ng phonemizer (milestone 4, unchanged)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45d814f4e58fbcebd0ce14e223cf65bf4c864d95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/45d814f4e58fbcebd0ce14e223cf65bf4c864d95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/9e9429e5f0878059984e2d638c136d85691deccd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/9e9429e5f0878059984e2d638c136d85691deccd","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDllOTQyOWU1ZjA4NzgwNTk5ODRlMmQ2MzhjMTM2ZDg1NjkxZGVjY2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f","sha":"49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f"}],"sha":"9e9429e5f0878059984e2d638c136d85691deccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/9e9429e5f0878059984e2d638c136d85691deccd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:16:55Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T13:19:53Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Add web_trainer milestone 4: Piper TTS in browser via espeak-ng WASM\n\nImplements fully in-browser text-to-speech using Piper VITS models:\n\n- vendor/espeak-ng/ — espeak-ng 1.51 C source compiled to WASM via\n  Emscripten; embeds minimal en+es phoneme data (884KB); exports\n  phonemize_init / phonemize(text, lang) → IPA / phonemize_free\n- src/phonemize.cpp — thin WASM wrapper (IPA mode, space-separated output)\n- www/js/piper.js — synthesis pipeline: IPA → phoneme IDs (voice config\n  map) → VITS inference (onnxruntime-web) → WAV; generateSamples() varies\n  noise_scale / length_scale / noise_w for acoustic diversity\n- www/index.html — UI: load .onnx + .onnx.json, type phrase, generate N\n  samples, play/download each as WAV\n- CMakeLists.txt — new piper_phonemize target; auto-copies outputs to www/\n- Playwright test suite: 8 tests covering IPA output for all production\n  phrases (en/es) and phoneme ID mapping; all passing in 2.9s\n\nBuild requires libespeak-ng-dev installed on the host.\nRun: cd web_trainer && npx playwright test\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8e89ed55f49076dadffa4522c6d00dc6172114d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/a8e89ed55f49076dadffa4522c6d00dc6172114d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f","node_id":"C_kwDOS1dFg9oAKDQ5Mzk1ZmRhZmQwOGE4OWFmMTcwODhhMWI3MTdhODBjODI0ZjQwNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/bb04e3e3ab6a7a4c8061a9ec14d2d78118dd2cab","sha":"bb04e3e3ab6a7a4c8061a9ec14d2d78118dd2cab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/bb04e3e3ab6a7a4c8061a9ec14d2d78118dd2cab"}],"sha":"49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/49395fdafd08a89af17088a1b717a80c824f405f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commits/bb04e3e3ab6a7a4c8061a9ec14d2d78118dd2cab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T00:47:38Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T00:47:38Z","email":"aadjiman@gmail.com","name":"adji"},"message":"Add web_trainer milestones 2+3: MixedNet forward pass and backprop in C++/WASM\n\nMilestone 2 — MixedNet forward pass:\n- nn.h/cpp: conv1d_valid, depthwise_conv1d_valid, pointwise_conv,\n  batchnorm_infer, relu_inplace, avg_pool_global\n- mixednet.h/cpp: MixedNet struct matching production config\n  (first_conv k=5 stride=3 → 4 MixConv blocks → global-avg-pool → Dense+sigmoid),\n  init_random, forward, min_input_frames, get/set_params\n\nMilestone 3 — Backpropagation + Adam optimizer:\n- nn.h/cpp: backward primitives for all forward ops + bce_loss\n- mixednet.h/cpp: ForwardCache, forward_cached, backward, Adam (init/step)\n- main.cpp: WASM exports adam_create/destroy/set_lr, train_step\n- BN mean/var frozen; only gamma/beta trained via gradient\n- Smoke test: loss 0.692 → 0.019 in 20 Adam steps\n\nWASM output: 13KB JS + 49KB WASM\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6749519433b701af96857aef8a5a4a189911201b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/trees/6749519433b701af96857aef8a5a4a189911201b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/git/commits/bb04e3e3ab6a7a4c8061a9ec14d2d78118dd2cab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1459522?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i","id":1459522,"login":"a-d-j-i","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTk1MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/a-d-j-i","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/a-d-j-i/wakeword-relay/commit/bb