ttps://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/a10bb7c39064f3df2db0fbf8d55a1fdda45a16af","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKGExMGJiN2MzOTA2NGYzZGYyZGIwZmJmOGQ1NWExZmRkYTQ1YTE2YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee","sha":"ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee"}],"sha":"a10bb7c39064f3df2db0fbf8d55a1fdda45a16af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/a10bb7c39064f3df2db0fbf8d55a1fdda45a16af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:17:23Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:17:23Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for Code Generation (17/20)\n\nFixed a genuine main-page inaccuracy in code-generation.ts, verified\nagainst GraphQL Code Generator''s own client-preset docs before\npublishing: the \"Client Usage\" codeTab''s own comment claimed\n`data.post.author.name has type string` for a field spread with a\nfragment (`author { ...AuthorFields }`) -- but client-preset enables\nfragment masking BY DEFAULT, meaning that field is generated as an\nopaque `FragmentType<...>`, not the real shape. Direct access is a\ncompile error; `useFragment()` is required to unmask it. Fixed the\ncodeTab''s comment and tightened the client-preset theory bullet to\nstate the real default behavior.\n\nThree subtopics:\n- fragment-masking-blocks-direct-access (fix-adjacent)\n- near-operation-file-preset (gap-closing -- the QnA names it in one\n  sentence, never sets it up; verified the real two-output config\n  shape and the documents-glob exclusion gotcha)\n- authenticated-introspection-endpoint (gap-closing -- both auth\n  approaches the QnA names, verified against the real schema-field\n  headers config syntax)\n\nWired all 6 touchpoints per the established recipe. Build passed\nclean. Browser-verified: nav accordion opens with all 3 labels (17\ntoggles total across the hub); both main-page fixes confirmed\nrendering live; all 3 subtopic pages checked individually -- correct\nbreadcrumb (all 4 levels), 860px wrapper, tailored sidebar content,\nzero console errors.\n\nThis completes the GraphQL hub''s Client nav group (apollo-client,\nclient-caching, code-generation -- all 3 of 3 topics now have\nsubtopics). GraphQL hub Phase 10: 17 of 20 topics complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"752b1793e251013cbc69680523572d65f1a94a4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/752b1793e251013cbc69680523572d65f1a94a4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/ed2deb8425f757e4db70e66cbb3eb902161192ee","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKGVkMmRlYjg0MjVmNzU3ZTRkYjcwZTY2Y2JiM2ViOTAyMTYxMTkyZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/4c4123668826f5b9f567056b3c64e64d2e663c68","sha":"4c4123668826f5b9f567056b3c64e64d2e663c68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/4c4123668826f