thub.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/c55b25f66b6254f3d4db0c3fe042a9ba9cf92066/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:18:27Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T00:18:27Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for Apollo Server (13/20)\n\n- Fixed a QnA inaccuracy claiming introspection changed to \"on in all\n  environments\" in v4 -- verified against Apollo''s own docs it is still\n  NODE_ENV-gated and was never a v3-to-v4 change at all.\n- New subtopic: Introspection Is Still NODE_ENV-Gated -- Not a v3-to-v4\n  Change.\n- New subtopic: executeOperation''s ''incremental'' Response Kind, and Why\n  You Probably Won''t See It -- explains response.body.kind''s ''single''\n  vs ''incremental'' discriminated union and why @defer/@stream (needing\n  an alpha graphql-js v17 + explicit SDL opt-in) rarely reaches it.\n- New subtopic: executeOperation''s contextValue Is Shallow-Cloned, Not\n  Shared by Reference -- verified directly against the installed\n  @apollo/server source (cloneObject via Object.assign) and a live\n  Node.js test that a plugin mutation of contextValue never leaks back\n  to the caller''s original object.\n- Wired all 6 touchpoints: app.routes.ts (children array), subtopics.ts,\n  gql-nav.ts (accordion), breadcrumb.ts, page-sidebar.ts, search.service.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d5ecd16c0d3982122fe227828123da2ffc44501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/2d5ecd16c0d3982122fe227828123da2ffc44501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/c55b25f66b6254f3d4db0c3fe042a9ba9cf92066","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use