iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/b384ea7476fe15311c9db5f58f0497bfcebc87c4","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKGIzODRlYTc0NzZmZTE1MzExYzlkYjVmNThmMDQ5N2JmY2ViYzg3YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/3110b7e08b3ac3339646e46fee47b0097ac588bd","sha":"3110b7e08b3ac3339646e46fee47b0097ac588bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/3110b7e08b3ac3339646e46fee47b0097ac588bd"}],"sha":"b384ea7476fe15311c9db5f58f0497bfcebc87c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/b384ea7476fe15311c9db5f58f0497bfcebc87c4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/3110b7e08b3ac3339646e46fee47b0097ac588bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:44:56Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T18:44:56Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for DataLoader & N+1 (11/20)\n\n- Tightened a theory bullet: \"batchScheduleFn... by default uses\n  process.nextTick\" is imprecise -- verified by reading the installed\n  dataloader v2.2.3 package''s own source directly that the real default\n  is resolvedPromise.then(() => process.nextTick(fn)), a microtask that\n  then schedules the nextTick job, not a bare process.nextTick(fn) call.\n- 3 new subtopics, all verified via direct execution against the real,\n  npm-installed dataloader package:\n  - The Default Batch Scheduler Is a Microtask, Not a Bare\n    process.nextTick (fix-adjacent): the verified mechanism, plus the\n    practical consequence -- a load() call after any number of\n    microtask-only awaits (confirmed up to 50 chained hops) still joins\n    the original batch; only a genuine macrotask breaks out.\n  - cacheKeyFn Is Required to Deduplicate Object Keys (gap-closing): the\n    default cacheKeyFn is the identity function, so structurally-equal\n    object keys built separately are NOT deduplicated -- verified via\n    execution showing batch size 2 without cacheKeyFn vs. 1 with it.\n  - maxBatchSize Splits One Tick Into Multiple Batch Calls (gap-closing):\n    verified the exact chunking behavior the QnA names but never shows\n    -- 7 keys with maxBatchSize:3 chunk into 3 separate batch calls,\n    every load() still resolving correctly.\n- Wired all 6 touchpoints: routes, subtopics.ts, gql-nav.ts, breadcrumb.ts,\n  page-sidebar.ts, search.service.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d6e7010795cc85e8cfe2b4662eeb7d8ec15a25b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/9d6e7010795cc85e8cfe2b4662eeb7d8ec15a25b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/3110b7e08b3ac3339646e46fee47b0097ac588bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","sign