"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/486f02e77eb38f60f202863dcc62cc80ffb70dfc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:48:48Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T13:48:48Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for Mutation Error Handling (8/20)\n\n- Fixed a genuine staleness bug: the main page''s own Quick Reference and\n  a theory bullet listed AuthenticationError, ForbiddenError,\n  UserInputError, and ApolloError as if still importable -- Apollo\n  Server 4 removed all four entirely (verified via Apollo''s own docs).\n- 3 subtopics: (1) the v4 removal, with a v3-vs-v4 codeTab comparison\n  and a Try It on a local wrapper-function replacement; (2) the payload\n  UserErrors pattern the page''s own QnA names but never builds --\n  schema, resolver, and client; (3) the ApolloServerErrorCode enum\n  (never mentioned on the page) for distinguishing Apollo''s own\n  pre-execution failures from resolver-thrown ones in formatError.\n- SUBTOPICS key hub-prefixed to gql-error-handling (bare ''error-handling''\n  already claimed by the JavaScript hub). All 6 touchpoints wired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2b4c767070698a11bfb8ed9ec66918cacf123a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/e2b4c767070698a11bfb8ed9ec66918cacf123a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/486f02e77eb38f60f202863dcc62cc80ffb70dfc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/oth