"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/4e70aca02a85eaf06286b0098a9b470481dac622/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:15:53Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:15:53Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for Type System Deep Dive (3/20)\n\n- Fix one genuine main-page inaccuracy: the \"Abstract Types & resolveType\"\n  theory bullet claimed GraphQL \"falls back to instanceof checks\" without\n  __resolveType. graphql-js has no instanceof path -- the default reads\n  __typename off the value, then calls each member''s isTypeOf, then throws.\n  This already matched the page''s own mistakes block and QnA.\n- 3 subtopics, each verified via direct Node execution:\n  * the real default-resolveType order modelled, with a Try It on an ORM\n    returning class instances (still needs isTypeOf / __typename)\n  * unwrapping introspection ofType -- NON_NULL/LIST nodes have name: null;\n    render the nested tree back to [Post!]! / [[Int!]!]!\n  * disabling introspection != hiding the schema -- \"Did you mean\" field\n    suggestions still leak names; clairvoyance automates reconstruction;\n    fixes are blockFieldSuggestions + an operation allowlist\n- SUBTOPICS key type-system checked collision-free, left bare.\n- GqlNavComponent toggle wired. All 6 touchpoints wired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56dd408db9e2d9f90d3dab78503d8907f4482ec3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/56dd408db9e2d9f90d3dab78503d8907f4482ec3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/4e70aca02a85eaf06286b0098a9b470481dac622","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"av