mits/cb7466113dc389eb69d563fadeda18b650123356/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:04:00Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T03:04:00Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for Schema Definition Language (2/20)\n\n- Tighten two genuine main-page inaccuracies found during authoring:\n  * the \"non-null argument means the argument is required\" theory bullet\n    omits the spec''s default-value carve-out (limit: Int! = 10 is optional\n    to supply; explicit null still rejected). Rewrote to state both halves.\n  * the \"Forgetting __typename in union queries\" mistake commented \"crashes\n    if result is a User\" -- no crash: an unmatched fragment yields {}. Fixed\n    the comment and explanation.\n- 3 subtopics, each verified via direct Node execution:\n  * the two-part required-argument rule as an is-this-valid model\n  * union selection sets: unmatched member -> {}, and a union has no\n    directly-selectable fields except __typename (verified vs the spec)\n  * custom scalar serialize/parseValue/parseLiteral -- which hook runs for\n    inline literals (AST node) vs. variables vs. resolver output\n- SUBTOPICS key schema-definition-language checked collision-free, left bare.\n- GqlNavComponent toggle wired. All 6 touchpoints wired.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8648e9d5da44b56079c56b325abb23e4083412cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/8648e9d5da44b56079c56b325abb23e4083412cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/cb7466113dc389eb69d563fadeda18b650123356","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","fol