"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T02:45:34Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(graphql): add Phase 10 subtopics for GraphQL Fundamentals (pilot, 1/20)\n\n- Fix a genuine cross-codeTab bug on the main page: the \"First Query\" schema\n  declared Post with no author field, but the \"Mutation & Subscription\" tab''s\n  subscription selects postPublished { ... author { name } } -- GraphQL rejects\n  that at schema validation before any resolver runs. Added author: User! to\n  match the Challenge solution''s own Post type.\n- 3 subtopics: the undeclared-author-field mismatch made executable; non-null\n  error propagation / null bubbling (cross-checked against the GraphQL spec);\n  aliases resolving same-field-different-args conflicts. All claimed executor\n  outputs verified via direct Node execution.\n- GqlNavComponent had zero subtopics-accordion support (17th *NavComponent hub\n  in a row) -- added signal/Router/NavigationEnd/filter/SUBTOPICS imports, the\n  three accordion methods, and the constructor router subscription.\n- SUBTOPICS key hub-prefixed to gql-fundamentals (bare fundamentals is claimed\n  by the JavaScript hub).\n- Wired all 6 touchpoints: app.routes.ts, subtopics.ts, gql-nav.ts,\n  breadcrumb.ts, page-sidebar.ts, search.service.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"648ddea1cc0daeb24ef2ad52fd89f8b9d8834f68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/648ddea1cc0daeb24ef2ad52fd89f8b9d8834f68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/a3e0a8fc4e2429aed56f456b469efebef1c89aed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","follo