evHub/commits/7f6fd905bf436cd8e738fc656c4621d0bdcb4bef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:57:50Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:57:50Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(redis): add Phase 10 subtopics for Redis Security (21/21 -- hub complete)\n\nFixed 4 genuine main-page issues, all verified against Redis''s own primary\nsources:\n- Challenge''s own auditAclViolations() misparsed ACL LOG''s object field as\n  \"command|key\" -- it''s actually a single-purpose field whose meaning\n  depends on the reason field, verified against Redis''s own ACL LOG docs.\n  Fixed by extracting the real command from client-info''s cmd= token.\n- Protected-mode QnA claimed bind status matters -- verified via Redis''s\n  own networking.c accept-time check that only whether the default user\n  has NOPASS matters (reused the finding already debunked once on the\n  Installation & Setup page).\n- Theory bullet claimed lua-time-limit 0 disables Lua scripts -- verified\n  via Redis''s own redis.conf source comments that 0 actually DISABLES the\n  busy-script-detection mechanism, the opposite of restricting anything.\n  Real fix is denying the @scripting ACL category.\n- RESET QnA version precision: \"(Redis 6+)\" -> \"(Redis 6.2+, not 6.0)\".\n\n3 subtopics added:\n- Parsing ACL LOG''s object Field Correctly (fix-adjacent)\n- Restricting EVAL Access via ACL -@scripting (fix-adjacent)\n- ACL SAVE Requires an aclfile (gap-closing -- CONFIG REWRITE and ACL SAVE\n  are mode-specific, not interchangeable, verified via Redis''s own docs)\n\nSUBTOPICS key hub-prefixed to redis-security (bare security collides with\nthe SQL hub''s own topic). Wired all 6 touchpoints. Build clean.\nBrowser-verified: nav accordion opens with all 3 links (21 toggles total\nacross the hub), all 4 main-page fixes render live, all 3 subtopic pages\nchecked -- breadcrumb, 860px wrapper, tailored sidebar, no console errors.\n\nThis completes the Redis hub''s entire Phase 10 rollout -- all 21 topics\nnow have deep-dive subtopic pages, 63 subtopic pages total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77a21a8072e4293cbd80c14f7bf02381d3a47cb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/77a21a8072e4293cbd80c14f7bf02381d3a47cb4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/7f6fd905bf436cd8e738fc656c4621d0bdcb4bef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/7f6fd905bf436cd8e738fc656c4621d0bdcb4bef","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKDdmNmZkOTA1YmY0MzZjZDhlNzM4ZmM2NTZjNDYyMWQwYmRjYjRiZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/5e86b4e692dbc07fbb334780a65c820b02c630e5","sha":"5e86b4e692dbc07fbb334780a65c820b02c630e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/5e86b4e692dbc07fbb33478