Karthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commits/479b1571237a516b8f2b4d121113c59948205190/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:36:10Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:36:10Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(redis): add Phase 10 subtopics for Redis with Node.js\n\n- 3 subtopics: WATCH retry loops need a dedicated connection; typed\n  defineCommand() without the as any cast; a real health-check\n  endpoint with a PING timeout\n- Fixed a duplicate theory section on the main page (same recurring\n  pattern already found on caching-patterns/redis-cluster/redis-stack\n  this hub)\n- Fixed an obsolete connect-redis factory-function API in the Session\n  Store codeTab -- current as of v6 only, verified via the npm\n  registry''s own version timestamps that the API changed twice since\n  (v7: default export, no session arg; v8+: named export), current\n  major version v10 uses `import { RedisStore } from ''connect-redis''`\n  with `new RedisStore({ client })` directly\n- Fixed a quiz explanation repeating the same incomplete Pub/Sub\n  allowed-command list already found and fixed on this hub''s own\n  pub-sub page earlier this session\n- Subtopics verified via direct Node.js execution: a FakeConnection\n  simulation reproducing both a false abort and a false success\n  (the dangerous one) from sharing one connection across concurrent\n  WATCH operations; ioredis''s own official TypeScript\n  declaration-merging pattern for defineCommand(); a PING-vs-timeout\n  race verified across healthy/hung/down cases\n- Wired all 6 touchpoints (routes, subtopics map, nav accordion,\n  breadcrumb, sidebar, search index)\n\nRedis hub Phase 10: 20 of 21 topics complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"400a422c4b8516bc60844116c489c084cbf13ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/400a422c4b8516bc60844116c489c084cbf13ce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/479b1571237a516b8f2b4d121113c59948205190","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/479b1571237a516b8f2b4d121113c59948205190","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKDQ3OWIxNTcxMjM3YTUxNmI4ZjJiNGQxMjExMTNjNTk5NDgyMDUxOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.