the Redis 8.0\n  timeline; a real JS truthiness trap in FT.INFO''s indexing field\n  (a literal \"0\"/\"1\" string, so a naive !info.indexing check is\n  broken for both states); per-tenant hash-tag co-location reusing\n  extractHashTagSubstring from the sibling redis-cluster batch\n- Wired all 6 touchpoints (routes, subtopics map, nav accordion,\n  breadcrumb, sidebar, search index)\n\nRedis hub Phase 10: 19 of 21 topics complete.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dfc159e2a6759c30ada28b1f559d65990655e39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/4dfc159e2a6759c30ada28b1f559d65990655e39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/caf83d707fae67246a33b3540c0ceff13fff85cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik","id":20870970,"login":"AjkKarthik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODcwOTcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AjkKarthik/DevHub/commit/caf83d707fae67246a33b3540c0ceff13fff85cb","node_id":"C_kwDOS1oxFNoAKGNhZjgzZDcwN2ZhZTY3MjQ2YTMzYjM1N