date":"2026-09-08T13:45:43Z","email":"ajkkarthik@hotmail.com","name":"Ajk Karthik"},"message":"feat(redis): add Phase 10 subtopics for Lua Scripting\n\n- 3 subtopic pages: Redis rejects global variables (it doesn''t leak\n  them), scripts no longer need to be deterministic since Redis 7.0,\n  redis.set_repl() for skipping replication of throwaway writes\n- Fixed the strongest bug found in this hub so far: the \"Using global\n  variables\" mistake block had the sandbox''s actual behavior exactly\n  backwards. It claimed a global assignment silently persists shared\n  state between EVAL calls -- verified via two independent sources\n  that Redis''s sandbox actually REJECTS global-variable creation\n  outright with a named error (\"Script attempted to create global\n  variable ''name''\"), aborting the script immediately every time\n- Fixed a stale QnA claim that scripts \"must be deterministic for\n  AOF/replication\" -- verified this described verbatim replication,\n  removed entirely as of Redis 7.0 (effects replication is now the\n  only mode), so math.random/TIME/SRANDMEMBER are all safe to use\n  freely\n- Wired: routes, subtopics map (left bare, confirmed collision-free),\n  RedisNavComponent accordion, breadcrumb, sidebar, search index\n- Redis hub Phase 10: 10 of 21 topics complete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9db5bfa652d88ceca1b947d46d145718478035ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/trees/9db5bfa652d88ceca1b947d46d145718478035ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AjkKarthik/DevHub/git/commits/acc33bb2c90cb8e7376810528ccdb5a720b42269","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20870970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AjkKarthik/followers","following_url":"https://api.git