eploys now fully unwind their UI\n(re-deriving the stepper from server state instead of wedging buttons —\nalso the Bugbot finding). Pull stats fail loudly instead of fabricating\nzeros, the dead /api/compute and /api/lifecycle/state endpoints are gone,\nthe dashboard poll skips unchanged DOM (log signature, spark/cache\ncompare-assign, hidden-tab pause), and the three readiness loops collapse\ninto one waitForHttpOk export.","tree":{"sha":"1905ec33ff9c9559c7f82e8aac71891f54088de2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/git/trees/1905ec33ff9c9559c7f82e8aac71891f54088de2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/git/commits/d7fbc887f88bc0e953b596f9a0b091659a6cec9a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commit/d7fbc887f88bc0e953b596f9a0b091659a6cec9a","node_id":"C_kwDOS1qzxNoAKGQ3ZmJjODg3Zjg4YmMwZTk1M2I1OTZmOWEwYjA5MTY1OWE2Y2VjOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commit/16fd91e6636dba79dab566a6bfd70ade0f71dfb1","sha":"16fd91e6636dba79dab566a6bfd70ade0f71dfb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commits/16fd91e6636dba79dab566a6bfd70ade0f71dfb1"}],"sha":"d7fbc887f88bc0e953b596f9a0b091659a6cec9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commits/d7fbc887f88bc0e953b596f9a0b091659a6cec9a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commits/16fd91e6636dba79dab566a6bfd70ade0f71dfb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:56:00Z","email":"zack@module-federation.io","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T02:56:00Z","email":"zack@module-federation.io","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"message":"Fix CI bindgen bin resolution and honor published types in config bindgen\n\nThe 