pute/commits/f94a7054a4a40769928a127388cb3dbbff68b352"}],"sha":"f768be873bdbd2f1743f4d4a8fe6376658a3f908","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commits/f768be873bdbd2f1743f4d4a8fe6376658a3f908"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commits/f94a7054a4a40769928a127388cb3dbbff68b352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T21:59:37Z","email":"zack@module-federation.io","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T21:59:37Z","email":"zack@module-federation.io","name":"ScriptedAlchemy"},"message":"Rework the web demo around the raw MF runtime so federation is visible\n\nThe host is now a stock createInstance + host.loadRemote() consumer\n(module-federation.io shape) instead of generated-binding magic. Every\nexample card shows the verbatim host code that powers it, a live topology\nmaps the browser -> host process -> machine chain (every edge labeled with\nits loadRemote id), and each interaction exposes a collapsible wire trace\nbuilt from real plugin-hook data: entry resolution, manifest/version\nnegotiation, and the literal POST /mf/call payloads and responses. Adds an\ninteractive snapshot card (boot -> freeze to .snap -> restore by entry\nswap, counter surviving the kill) and unifies both pages under shared tabs.","tree":{"sha":"b5d6cc6aa12df37d24f1ade07395242872ca9734","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/git/trees/b5d6cc6aa12df37d24f1ade07395242872ca9734"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/git/commits/f94a7054a4a40769928a127388cb3dbbff68b352","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/ScriptedAlchemy/federated-compute/commit/f94a7054a4a40769928a127388cb3dbbff68b352","node_id":"C_kwDOS1qzxNoAKGY5NGE3MDU0YTRhNDA3Njk5MjhhMTI3Mzg4Y2IzZGJiZmY2OGIzNTI","parents":[{"ht