-parent pom names itself\nBEFORE its <parent>, so every generated service kept 0.0.1-SNAPSHOT (\"no app-parent version\nfound\"). Now the <parent> block is blanked and the first <version> left is the project''s own,\nwhichever order the pom uses. A PATCH under semver.\n\nRED: the spec''s new real-order fixture failed (1/7); GREEN 63/63, and the function reads 3.0.0 from\nthe actual saathratri/app-parent/pom.xml.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BnzbQ4yj6s9MULYuohBJq9","tree":{"sha":"83ea733ceeffd1e711be036845d5742a9cb5b99a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/83ea733ceeffd1e711be036845d5742a9cb5b99a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/20d15223888b8568dbd11e7db82f8be85e8016b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https: