 9.4.0\n\n- yeoman-generator 9 refuses destinations outside the app root:\n  spring-boot-orchestrator sets allowDestinationOutsideRoot (it writes the\n  sibling ../<baseName>dto/ Maven module on purpose).\n- CSP: script-src gains blob: for Angular microfrontends (Native Federation''s\n  es-module-shims), mirroring upstream, both theme branches.\n- sql-*/cassandra-* re-derived from the upgraded bases (ai-postgresql +\n  cassandra 9.4.0 ports: Native Federation, Jackson 3, Cassandra loader pin,\n  ResourceIT/Asserts/Angular template fixes); identity check empty.\n- Snapshots updated for upstream file-set churn only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BnzbQ4yj6s9MULYuohBJq9","tree":{"sha":"221c2fe0ae0eaedb8a17dcb21feb71eff098f495","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/221c2fe0ae0eaedb8a17dcb21feb71eff098f495"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/efa9df05d10a20d4e042af520804eea7acbe5fbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starr