},"message":"feat: upgrade to JHipster 9.2.0\n\n- generator-jhipster 9.1.0 -> 9.2.0 (Spring Boot 4.0.7, Spring Cloud\n  2025.1.2, Angular 21.2.17 in generated apps)\n- Re-derive vendored sql-*/cassandra-* dirs from the upgraded bases\n  (byte-identity verified); picks up the Material/CDK tilde pin and the\n  ngx-translate 18 template fixes\n- Update angular/client snapshots: upstream renamed\n  translation.module.ts -> translation.provider.ts\n- heroku-orchestrator: fix new eslint no-useless-assignment error\n  (dead initializer in getMicroserviceName)\n- Sync CLAUDE.md/README version references\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01156RrGMtYDH5RHk1GQSC1n","tree":{"sha":"a2a5606c172ba8b7d6b0ffcd6a7bf820b939f678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/a2a5606c172ba8b7d6b0ffcd6a7bf820b939f678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/c4c2804f0607dd43b5cd4444badab58d8ba77e91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/c4c2804f0607dd43b5cd4444badab58d8ba77e91","node_id":"C_kwDOS1uwatoAKGM0YzI4MDRmMDYwN2RkNDNiNWNkNDQ0NGJhZGFiNThkOGJhNzdlOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec","sha":"28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec"}],"sha":"c4c2804f0607dd43b5cd4444badab58d8ba77e91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/c4c2804f0607dd43b5cd4444badab58d8ba77e91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:39:35Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:39:35Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(readme): npm link points at ~amarppatel again\n\nThe ~saathratri npm user account was deleted -- it turned out to be a user\naccount rather than the organization it was meant to be, so an organization\n(saathratri-llc) was created instead. That left the README pointing at a\nprofile that no longer exists.\n\nThe packages are still owned and published by the amarppatel npm account, so\nthat is what the link now says. The rest of the About section stays with\nSaathratri, LLC as publisher, which remains accurate: the company owns the\nrepositories and the copyright. Only the npm profile is personal, and naming it\nhonestly is better than a dead link to a company profile that does not exist.\n\nUnscoped packages cannot be moved into an npm organization from the CLI or the\npackage settings page -- `npm owner add saathratri-llc` fails with \"User not\nfound\" because owner lookups resolve users only. Moving them under the org\nneeds npm support.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QehTmCnTeGoyp5H7umjKvX","tree":{"sha":"6e6e23cf116d6d4af1149395ade54f6342f8c884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/6e6e23cf116d6d4af1149395ade54f6342f8c884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec","node_id":"C_kwDOS1uwatoAKDI4ZDI5YjllYWZiZjgwOWY3ZTdiMjMxMTQwMzhhMTM0ODFiMGVlZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e","sha":"10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e"}],"sha":"28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/28d29b9eafbf809f7e7b23114038a13481b0eeec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:11:50Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T20:11:50Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"ci: publish to npm via trusted publishing (OIDC), no stored token\n\nThe classic npm token was revoked mid-session on 2026-08-06 and publishing\nbroke with an E401 that npm surfaced as \"404 Not Found - PUT ... Not found\",\nwhich reads like a missing package rather than an auth failure. npm is also\nrestricting tokens that bypass 2FA (account changes Aug 2026, direct publishing\nJan 2027), so a stored credential was going to keep being a liability.\n\nThis workflow carries no NPM_TOKEN. npm verifies the workflow''s identity from\nGitHub''s OIDC token and mints a short-lived one, and --provenance attaches a\nsigned attestation linking each published tarball to the commit and workflow\nthat built it.\n\nTwo details that are easy to get wrong and are commented in the file:\n\n- id-token: write is required. Without it no OIDC token is minted and npm\n  silently falls back to asking for a credential that is not there.\n- Trusted publishing needs npm >= 11.5.1, which is newer than the npm bundled\n  with Node 22, so the workflow upgrades npm before publishing.\n\nThe npm-side Trusted Publisher must name both this repository and this file''s\nname: publish.yml is part of the trust assertion, so renaming the file or\nmoving the repo breaks publishing until npm is updated to match.\n\nAlso fails early with a clear message when the version is already on the\nregistry, instead of letting that surface as an opaque publish error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QehTmCnTeGoyp5H7umjKvX","tree":{"sha":"1226d0f37fc3068d66b53bdd07915e612feedf1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/1226d0f37fc3068d66b53bdd07915e612feedf1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/10c8b2a969d69a95ff21344217fd875e9195f08e","node_id":"C_kwDOS1uwatoAKDEwYzhiMmE5NjlkNjlhOTVmZj