th founder attribution\n\nThe README described a personal project: \"About the author\", website\namarppatel.com, github.com/amarpatel-xx, npmjs.com/~amarppatel. The\nrepositories now belong to the company''s GitHub account, and the packages are\nmoving to the company''s npm account, so the README should say who publishes it.\n\n\"About\" now leads with Saathratri, LLC and links the company''s website, GitHub,\nnpm and LinkedIn. Amar''s authorship is kept explicitly rather than erased --\nhe wrote it, and the personal GitHub and site links stay in that line. A README\nthat quietly dropped the author would be worse than one that never named him.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QehTmCnTeGoyp5H7umjKvX","tree":{"sha":"5e2dcbd05b7ff3bd737475ab6bfef8d0ff621a03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/5e2dcbd05b7ff3bd737475ab6bfef8d0ff621a03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/969e7aa11991cc81811915a1f000f7c7a176ec61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/am