rator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/b1673a98509c1549fc7bf6bde720d6576cd98902/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T20:24:55Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T20:24:55Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"docs(license): copyright holder is Saathratri, LLC\n\nThese repositories now belong to the company account and the work was authored\nfor the company, so the MIT copyright notice names Saathratri, LLC rather than\nAmar Premsaran Patel personally. The licence itself is unchanged and the\nrepositories stay public MIT.\n\nThe original creation year is preserved and extended to 2026 rather than\nreplaced, so the notice still reflects when the work actually began.\n\nNote the ordering: a copyright notice records ownership, it does not transfer\nit. The transfer is effected by the IP assignment between Amar Premsaran Patel\nand Saathratri, LLC, which already lists these repositories in Exhibit A and is\nstill with counsel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QehTmCnTeGoyp5H7umjKvX","tree":{"sha":"cfccf903f67f01821598dbd9ddc6b9a2ea6eb429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/cfccf903f67f01821598dbd9ddc6b9a2ea6eb429"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/b1673a98509c1549fc7bf6bde720d6576cd98902","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}",