marpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/9e4abc7c0a24eb9c813ca930eb45f6a8ca1acb5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:31:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T15:31:43Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(modernizer): modern Java idioms in generated SQL/pgvector code\n\nThe prod build''s modernizer-maven-plugin (3.4.0, pinned by JHipster core, runs\nonly under -Pprod) failed psqlblog + psqlstore\non ~164 violations. The blueprint''s overridden templates had frozen older\nidioms while JHipster core modernized them. Fix at the template level so the\nregenerated output is modernizer-clean and the fix survives every regen:\n\n- RepositoryWithBagRelationshipsImpl override: Collections.sort -> list.sort,\n  Collections.emptyList -> List.of (drop the now-unused Collections import).\n  Preserves the Saathratri all-ManyToMany customization the override exists for.\n- embedding templates (EmbeddingMigrationService, EmbeddingService, PgVectorType):\n  String.format(...) -> \"...\".formatted(...)\n- sql-spring-boot generator.js bulk-replace endpoint: Collections.emptySet()\n  -> java.util.Set.of()\n\nVerified: regen succeeds; both services build -Pprod with modernizer 0 violations.\nCassandra services were already clean. vitest 9/9 green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9R9UkhexwZYSmM4qUoeA4","tree":{"sha":"6d804bce9f8f134b885ff95e193b34147bfe9bcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/6d804bce9f8f134b885ff95e193b34147bfe9bcb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/9e4abc7c0a24eb9c813ca930eb45f6a8ca1acb5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/9e4abc7c0a24eb9c813ca930eb45f6a8ca1acb5b","node_id":"C_kwDOS1uwatoAKDllNGFiYzdjMGEyNGViOWM4MTNjYTkzMGViNDVmNmE4Y2ExYWNiNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40","sha":"fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40"}],"sha":"9e4abc7c0a24eb9c813ca930eb45f6a8ca1acb5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/9e4abc7c0a24eb9c813ca930eb45f6a8ca1acb5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commits/fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:38:47Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-25T14:38:47Z","email":"amarppatel1@gmail.com","name":"Amar Premsaran Patel"},"message":"fix(jhipster-9.1.0): drop `options` from command definitions\n\nJHipster 9.1.0 rejects an `options` key in a JHipsterCommandDefinition:\nbase-core/generator.js#parseCurrentCommand throws \"Options are not supported\nanymore in JHipster commands, please use configs instead\" whenever\n`commandDef.options` is truthy — and the empty `options: {}` stub every\ngenerator shipped is truthy, so it trips too.\n\nThe check is gated on `!skipChecks`, and the vitest harness sets skipChecks,\nso this was invisible to `npm test` and only surfaced during a full regen\n(`jhipster:workspaces#generateApplications` -> the first generator parsed).\n\nRemove the empty `options: {}` from every command.js (configs/arguments/import\nare preserved).\n\nVerified: vitest green; full orchestrator regen now completes successfully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9R9UkhexwZYSmM4qUoeA4","tree":{"sha":"caddc0c092aea561592e9fd11d5a80b237053058","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/caddc0c092aea561592e9fd11d5a80b237053058"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/commit/fe97d8b8304616d868660c9575d643428d4eec40","node_id":"C_kwDOS1uwatoAKGZlOTdkOGI4MzA0NjE2ZDg2ODY2MGM5NTc1ZDY0MzQyOGQ0ZWVjNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gith