format toolchain to match the base generators: replace\n  eslint 8.57 + .eslintrc.json with the eslint 9 flat config (eslint.config.ts),\n  bump prettier 3.8.1, vitest 3, node engines, and the shared devDeps. The old\n  eslint could not parse `??=` and reported ~5800 formatting-as-lint errors.\n- re-derive sql-*/cassandra-* from the (fixed) base generators via copy + namespace\n  rename, keeping them byte-identical to the bases (modulo the namespace)\n- fix a latent bug surfaced by the modern eslint no-undef: .blueprint/generate-sample\n  referenced an undefined BaseApplicationGenerator (should be BaseGenerator)\n- update cypress state snapshot (angular.json); prettier/eslint cleanup\n\nTests: 53/53 vitest passing (22 files); npm test green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9R9UkhexwZYSmM4qUoeA4","tree":{"sha":"ebee291feddf57710d3fe684b2a8fded2691c4ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/trees/ebee291feddf57710d3fe684b2a8fded2691c4ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/saathratri/generator-jhipster-orchestrator/git/commits/c7accec3aa25b1b418128f0f20f176dde8cb1972","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1010740?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/amarpatel-xx","id":1010740,"login":"amarpatel-xx","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTA3NDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarpatel-xx/received_events","repos_url":"