_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/commits/153918e72b606a3898b7af1fae1783188faa1e95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T01:09:14Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T01:09:14Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"message":"fix: resolve report session expiration and authentication errors\n\n- Fix reporting_session cookie: replace %{HTTP_HOST} with hardcoded ''localhost''\n  in Apache CO flag to prevent colon in ''localhost:8186'' from breaking cookie\n  attribute parsing (path was garbled as ''86400'' instead of ''/'')\n- Remove ensureNoSessionIdInRoot() which was deleting the JSESSIONID cookie\n  needed by reports server for session validation\n- Fix login controller to redirect to from= URL when already authenticated\n- Change report generation from window.open() to .get() with blob to\n  ensure cookies are sent with the request\n- Add Cache-Control: no-cache headers on /openmrs/* responses to prevent\n  browser from caching 304 responses that skip Set-Cookie headers\n- Add mod_headers and mod_setenvif module loads\n- Fix Secure flag on HTTP VirtualHost cookie (true -> false)\n- Add userName parameter to report URL\n- Add column headers fallback for empty results in MRUBasedOnPaymentTypeDeteil.sql","tree":{"sha":"c1dd3786b62f9d9d7cff5861a0c84dfa5d832214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/trees/c1dd3786b62f9d9d7cff5861a0c