m"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T18:30:00Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"message":"Add Clinical Reference Tools (CDSS) - comprehensive drug interactions, calculators, guidelines\n\n- 3 Docker microservices: Medical MCP (3010), Open Medicine (3011), CDSS Integration (3012)\n- Drug search via OpenFDA API with full label information\n- Drug safety check with 120+ clinically significant interactions (NSAIDs, antibiotics, anticoagulants, psychiatric meds, diabetes drugs, etc.)\n- 12+ clinical calculators (BMI, GCS, Wells PE, CURB-65, CHA2DS2-VASc, SOFA, PHQ-9, etc.)\n- 6 clinical guidelines (Sepsis-3, WHO CAP, ACC/AHA AF, GOLD COPD, RCP NEWS2, WHO Surgical Safety)\n- PubMed literature search (30M+ citations)\n- WHO health statistics by country\n- AngularJS UI module with 4 views: Drug Search, Calculators, Guidelines, Drug Safety Check\n- Updated README with detailed API reference and setup instructions","tree":{"sha":"1fe6d4ecaa1a7bf0823e9ee1b28554a6c9223f63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/trees/1fe6d4ecaa1a7bf0823e9ee1b28554a6c9223f63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/commits/d41d91060e957f51881c7b578301c6ce114e45d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292223203?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/biniamhusse-dotcom","id":292223203,"login":"biniamhusse-dotcom","node_id":"U_kgDOEWr44w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/orgs","rece