rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/commits/dba30ffb958bec9f47c0a6de6c46052be19786cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T08:00:40Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T08:00:40Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"message":"fix: robust DB restore — stop apps, terminate connections, docker cp\n\nRoot causes:\n- PostgreSQL DROP DATABASE fails when active connections exist\n- dropdb/createdb fails silently in some containers\n- zcat not available on Windows host\n\nFix:\n- Stop app containers (odoo, openelis) before dropping databases\n- Terminate active connections with pg_terminate_backend()\n- Use SQL DROP/CREATE instead of dropdb/createdb\n- Copy backup files into containers with docker cp, restore from inside\n- Auto-restart app containers after restore\n\nAll 5 DB scripts updated: openmrs, reports, odoo, clinlims, pacsdb","tree":{"sha":"ba724ce40a098cb1b17e3654b5a7a10be40b8259","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/trees/ba724ce40a098cb1b17e3654b5a7a10be40b8259"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/commits/dba30ffb958bec9f47c0a6de6c46052be19786cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292223203?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/biniamhusse-dotcom","id":292223203,"login":"biniamhusse-dotcom","node_id":"U_kgDOEWr44w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/