/api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/commits/d925a230d1d2e12241b69ab2ed1a0781e27cdf83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:26:10Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-14T05:26:10Z","email":"biniamhusse-dotcom@users.noreply.github.com","name":"biniamhusse-dotcom"},"message":"fix: DB restore DROP DATABASE + volume restore via docker run\n\nDatabase restore:\n- Use separate dropdb/createdb commands (PostgreSQL blocks DROP DATABASE\n  inside multi-command -c strings)\n- Prevents ''constraint already exists'' errors on Odoo/OpenELIS/PACS\n\nVolume restore:\n- Use ''docker run --rm -v VOLUME:/data -v BACKUP:/backup busybox tar''\n  instead of direct filesystem access\n- Works on Windows without /var/lib/docker/volumes permission errors\n- Removed VOL_BASE detection (no longer needed)","tree":{"sha":"94389e3b5776acbaeee4988b6290bf90b2c68c4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/trees/94389e3b5776acbaeee4988b6290bf90b2c68c4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/commits/d925a230d1d2e12241b69ab2ed1a0781e27cdf83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292223203?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/biniamhusse-dotcom","id":292223203,"login":"biniamhusse-dotcom","node_id":"U_kgDOEWr44w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/received_event