biniamhusse-dotcom"},"message":"Fix payment status, duplicate visits, provider errors, triage flows\n\n- Fix payment status: check INVOICED string instead of boolean true\n  (backend returns ''INVOICED'' from Odoo sale.order.line external_order_id)\n- Fix duplicate visits: remove isFromCurrentLocation filter in\n  patientVisitHistoryService.js, add visitUuid fallback in app.js\n- Fix provider errors: add unknownProvider fallback in encounterService.js,\n  fix currentProvider in 4 controllers (crTriage, erTriage, visitController,\n  prescriptionControl)\n- Triage: add Emergency/Regular/Ophta Registration Fee order creation,\n  update triage visit flows\n- Pediatric age: threshold 10 -> 18 for ward/visit-type filtering\n- Add shell scripts for fresh DB data wipe (OpenMRS, OpenELIS, Odoo)\n- Add Ophta Registration Fee SQL, update fresh_db scripts","tree":{"sha":"c95dc8218155cf4052f7472e92be694f32444d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/trees/c95dc8218155cf4052f7472e92be694f32444d23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/biniamhusse-dotcom/bini/git/commits/b99c7fc51a7b179a52fb242997beba53a5089388","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/292223203?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/biniamhusse-dotcom","id":292223203,"login":"biniamhusse-dotcom","node_id":"U_kgDOEWr44w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniamhusse-dotcom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/biniam