https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/cee00a3a8e9e306b6c166af4ea142716547e5b55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T22:25:34Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T22:27:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"bead: track 6 untracked briefs + the full fleet-navigator RFI response\n\nAll seven files existed only in the working tree and were invisible from CI''s\nvantage — the same failure mode core''s untracked-bead-ledger-vantage-gap brief\ndescribes, found while sweeping the fleet for unrecorded work.\n\n- 5 briefs dating back to 2026-06-18 (launchd processes panel, northstar control\n  surface, the S8 pair, the northstar-evolution pickup).\n- The 2026-08-08 cockpit v2 design brief, wrapped in a proper --- frontmatter\n  block to match its tracked siblings; it arrived with a loose key: value header,\n  which bead-lint reads as no frontmatter at all.\n- research/fleet-navigator-rfi-response.md — NOT a duplicate of the abridged copy\n  in the design bundle on prototype/fleet-navigator (24.8KB here vs 14.6KB there).\n  This is the fuller answer set; it is the interaction/data ground truth the v2\n  brief points at, and it existed nowhere else.\n\nNo source, config, or in-flight branch touched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb45a6d18