/api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/473eb9245b30277ce7a6c0b80019789e9e714aab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:45:38Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:45:38Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(fleet-structure): registry adapter + /api/fleet-structure (rm:rm-l1-morning-cockpit#S10)\n\nThe strategy layer the cockpit has never seen, as a read-only REST endpoint\nbeside the aggregate (NOT the G1 facade — RFI C16):\n\n- adapters/fleet-structure.ts: four independent local-file sources per RFI\n  A9/C15, each with its own AdapterHealth — core registry frontmatter +\n  northstar files across sibling repos, roadmap status: tallies, wayfinder\n  frontmatter, live ~/selfco/wiki counts (loop.ts precedent). No gh, no\n  network, no write path.\n- @cockpit/shared fleet-structure.ts: pure joins/tallies/edges/stats.\n  Provenance on every element: DERIVED tallies, JUDGMENT cluster assignment,\n  AUTHORED prose (RFI C17).\n- Membership joins to the REGISTRY, never REPO_META; unregistered = census −\n  registry derived at request time; census/registry disagreement rendered,\n  never hidden (TD-007): fairway + fieldwork-1 post-date the record, gcgcca →\n  capture-agent resolves as a rename, 4 residual repos carry no cluster claim.\n- A missing sibling repo degrades THAT entry with a health note, never the\n  snapshot (live-verified: l1-fieldwork-1 checkout absent).\n- fleet-authored.ts: the dated 2026-07-25 census record + cluster judgments +\n  navigator prose. Annotations join by slug and never create nodes.\n\nVitest on every parser and builder (19 new tests); full suite 269 green.\nLive smoke on :3041 matches the RFI stat rail: 20 NS / 13 roadmaps /\n17 ready · 111 queued · 67 merged · 1 dispatched / 9 maps / 709 vault pages.\n\nMovement proposal: ns:l1-morning-cockpit#P2 50% -> 54% — evidence: packages/{shared,server}/src/__tests__/fleet-structure.test.ts green; /api/fleet-structure live payload matches RFI A9 stat rail with entry-level degradation proven on absent fieldwork-1 checkout\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb32b589bd06e608a76f547983496677effe8928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/fb32b589bd06e608a76f547983496677effe8928"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/473eb9245b30277ce7a6c0b80019789e9e714aab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","