Ydg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/da1014608715b3253288ac22dea8571cb64a4d99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:04:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T17:04:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(watch): Anthropic watch Stage 1 — verified feeds, ledger, local-first rubric (#40)\n\nWatches Anthropic''s technical output directly instead of waiting for the creator\necosystem to repackage it. New CLI-only package @cockpit/watch: polls verified\nfeeds, dedups against a SQLite ledger, fetches article bodies, scores four\ndimensions with local Ollama, stages a <=3-item shortlist to disk.\n\nAcceptance test passes: the 2026-07-06 Fable 5 field guide surfaces at 0.76 with\na why-line grounded in fetched text, behind \"Choosing a Claude model and effort\nlevel in Claude Code\" at 0.91.\n\nDecisions (ADR-0015/0016/0017):\n- sources.yaml is the one feed registry; config.ts and reading.opml derive from\n  it. The two had already drifted on titles. Validator lives in @cockpit/shared\n  so both consumers share one implementation.\n- The watch package gets the repo''s first persistent store and first scheduled\n  job, scoped to itself. The read-only posture (ADR-0001/0005) is unchanged: it\n  is about systems of record, and this writes only its own history.\n- Multi-dimensional rubric, local-only. An actionability floor rescues\n  boring-but-must-act items a weighted mean buries; a thin-text ceiling stops\n  title-only judgements reaching the brief. authority is never model-scored.\n\nVerification: 247 tests, typecheck clean, contract:check green, 21/21 endpoints\nhealthy. The launchd plist is committed but NOT installed, pending two\nsupervised runs (house ritual from trace-triager).\n\nThree endpoints quarantined with reasons on record, none deleted or replaced:\nthe Anthropic YouTube feed 404s though its channel_id is correct; the HN query\nis available but imprecise; the conoro mirror is long dead.\n\n13 deviations logged in implementation-notes.md. The architecture-changing ones:\n#6 the prefilter was structurally blind to near-empty first-party feeds, #11 a\ncommit subject line scored 0.88 and topped the first brief, #13 the Gate-4 quiz\nbank found two real defects before a question was asked.\n\nGate 4 merge quiz: 0/5 (taught mode), gate waived by operator; both recorded in\nquiz-log.jsonl.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1561da9db148538b7bb95afd80dcbef6b9cf25b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/e1561da9db148538b7bb95afd80dcbef6b9cf25b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/da1014608715b3253288ac22dea8571cb64a4d99","verification":{"payload":"tree e1561da9db148538b7bb95afd80dcbef6b9cf25b\nparent cec56787febf1dea82dcf10e7e0f076f2bf3d599\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1785344658 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785344658 -0500\n\nfeat(watch): Anthropic watch Stage 1 — verified feeds, ledger, local-first rubric (#40)\n\nWatches Anthropic''s technical output directly instead of waiting for the creator\necosystem to repackage it. New CLI-only package @cockpit/watch: polls verified\nfeeds, dedups against a SQLite ledger, fetches article bodies, scores four\ndimensions with local Ollama, stages a <=3-item shortlist to disk.\n\nAcceptance test passes: the 2026-07-06 Fable 5 field guide surfaces at 0.76 with\na why-line grounded in fetched text, behind \"Choosing a Claude model and effort\nlevel in Claude Code\" at 0.91.\n\nDecisions (ADR-0015/0016/0017):\n- sources.yaml is the one feed registry; config.ts and reading.opml derive from\n  it. The two had already drifted on titles. Validator lives in @cockpit/shared\n  so both consumers share one implementation.\n- The watch package gets the repo''s first persistent store and first scheduled\n  job, scoped to itself. The read-only posture (ADR-0001/0005) is unchanged: it\n  is about systems of record, and this writes only its own history.\n- Multi-dimensional rubric, local-only. An actionability floor rescues\n  boring-but-must-act items a weighted mean buries; a thin-text ceiling stops\n  title-only judgements reaching the brief. authority is never model-scored.\n\nVerification: 247 tests, typecheck clean, contract:check green, 21/21 endpoints\nhealthy. The launchd plist is committed but NOT installed, pending two\nsupervised runs (house ritual from trace-triager).\n\nThree endpoints quarantined with reasons on record, none deleted or replaced:\nthe Anthropic YouTube feed 404s though its channel_id is correct; the HN query\nis available but imprecise; the conoro mirror is long dead.\n\n13 deviations logged in implementation-notes.md. The architecture-changing ones:\n#6 the prefilter was structurally blind to near-empty first-party feeds, #11 a\ncommit subject line scored 0.88 and topped the first brief, #13 the Gate-4 quiz\nbank found two real defects before a question was asked.\n\nGate 4 merge quiz: 0/5 (taught mode), gate waived by operator; both recorded in\nquiz-log.jsonl.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqajKSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAICgQAHRCioAwYb2ODAgKhWnO1ScP\nwj06FqBbWWvFZdEFX4qJ5pYF6Qo8M6EpYal6uW5U7b7JFxw97elsUQBh/q9i81Md\nzRI1eumfToneO3xaXPSylBLb5z5DuZxMA3aihLm5wFxzeEaaZyJApWo9FxYtDxCs\niPIpF