","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/4ad72326fbc6ca317b5a2bbaf5c856edd70bef42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:21:47Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:21:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(handoff): derive decided-in-flight from closes: refs (rm:rm-l1-morning-cockpit#S8) (#34)\n\nApprove & emit (ADR-0005) writes a successor brief carrying\nrefs: [closes:<old-bead-id>], but closes: was write-only — after an\nemission both beads stayed live open-hook briefs, so deciding *raised*\nthe Pickup count and the Briefing re-seeded the identical DECISION\nNEEDED thread until delivery.\n\nRead-side derivation, never bead mutation:\n\n- packages/shared/decided.ts (new, pure + vitest): parseClosesRefs,\n  deriveDecidedInFlight (open successor''s closes: ref -> live\n  predecessor; dangling refs no-op; closed successor reverts; latest\n  created_at wins ties), foldedChainFor (transitive folded stack —\n  the live data already chains three deep).\n- WorkItem.chain?: ChainedPredecessor[] — derived, never stored.\n- adapters/handoff.ts: parse refs: frontmatter, index closes: refs\n  globally across scanned repos, fold predecessors under their\n  successor as one chained item; folded count in the health note.\n- Renderer: chained-pair card block (\"decided -> in flight\" marker +\n  folded predecessor rows), OJF tokens only.\n- CLAUDE.md: Honest-gaps entry rewritten from open-gap to shipped\n  behavior.\n\nSuite 162 -> 183 green; browser-verified against the real on-disk\npair: Pickup 19 -> 17 (2 folded), decided items gone from the\nBriefing pool, /api/health note honest.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"806a0b30e1517456c50893070bdad75a72a054fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/806a0b30e1517456c50893070bdad75a72a054fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/4ad72326fbc6ca317b5a2bbaf5c856edd70bef42","verification":{"payload":"tree 806a0b30e1517456c50893070bdad75a72a054fe\nparent 5379e21f06752f92fc3e08b7491af56a696625b2\nauthor ojfbot <151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com> 1784845307 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784845307 -0500\n\nfeat(handoff): derive decided-in-flight from closes: refs (rm:rm-l1-morning-cockpit#S8) (#34)\n\nApprove & emit (ADR-0005) writes a successor brief carrying\nrefs: [closes:<old-bead-id>], but closes: was write-only — after an\nemission both beads stayed live open-hook briefs, so deciding *raised*\nthe Pickup count and the Briefing re-seeded the identical DECISION\nNEEDED thread until delivery.\n\nRead-side derivation, never bead mutation:\n\n- packages/shared/decided.ts (new, pure + vitest): parseClosesRefs,\n  deriveDecidedInFlight (open successor''s closes: ref -> live\n  predecessor; dangling refs no-op; closed successor reverts; latest\n  created_at wins ties), foldedChainFor (transitive folded stack —\n  the live data already chains three deep).\n- WorkItem.chain?: ChainedPredecessor[] — derived, never stored.\n- adapters/handoff.ts: parse refs: frontmatter, index closes: refs\n  globally across scanned repos, fold predecessors under their\n  successor as one chained item; folded count in the health note.\n- Renderer: chained-pair card block (\"decided -> in flight\" marker +\n  folded predecessor rows), OJF tokens only.\n- CLAUDE.md: Honest-gaps entry rewritten from open-gap to shipped\n  behavior.\n\nSuite 162 -> 183 green; browser-verified against the real on-disk\npair: Pickup 19 -> 17 (2 folded), deci