ed by the acted boolean, never double-bucketed.\n\nRate suppression at the read-model (ADR-0095): no percentage renders until\ncore''s S6 capture-quality artifact exists (COCKPIT_CAPTURE_QUALITY_FILE probe);\nuntil then the skills table shows followed counts with a RATES UNVERIFIED badge.\n\nVerified live: 364 events, installed 93/16/0/2/1, uninstalled 224/26/0/2/0,\nlegacy zeroed, badge rendering. 162 tests green, typecheck clean.\n\nMovement proposal: ns:l1-core#P1 45% -> 55% — evidence: Loop pane renders era-split funnels + suppressed rates against the rebuilt ledger; S7 delivered ahead of S6 so movement recorded from live current 45, not the authored 60\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f4e7ff58aedc783186c4774c2a4d66e63e98c41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/3f4e7ff58aedc783186c4774c2a4d66e63e98c41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/e0fd64de66907f96029e125fc722ba53efc452ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot