etry read-model\n\nCapture health, disposition funnel (zeros rendered explicitly), top-suggested\nskills, and odometer/audit freshness from three independently-degradable\nread-only sources: ~/selfco/tracking/skill-dispositions.jsonl (core''s\nshadow-mode OPAV hooks, ADR-0095), status.jsonl re-read beside the delivery\nadapter, and an mtime probe of the weekly skill-architecture-audit output.\nOwn endpoint /api/loop beside /api/cockpit; snapshot contract and GraphQL\nfacade untouched. First render is the honest state: 199 events, 0 followed,\n0 acted, capture stale at 3 days.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b7bab9b0512bd5174b761bb6c622b59973e5541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/9b7bab9b0512bd5174b761bb6c622b59973e5541"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/6f5b8e0726be91ed62820f8b64fe6f8141fe80c8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/