 6 → ESM-only\n@exodus/bytes) transitively require()s an ES module, which only works on\nruntimes with require(ESM) support — Node 20.19+/22.12+. The engines floor\nwas >=20.18.1, one patch below where that lands, so a fresh node@20.18.x\n(or the Node 18 this shell defaulted to) fails at vitest env setup with\nERR_REQUIRE_ESM before any test runs. The tests are fine — 17/17 renderer\n+ 99 shared + 29 server all pass on 20.19.0.\n\n- engines.node: >=20.18.1 -> >=20.19.0 (the real floor for the dep tree)\n- add .nvmrc (24.11.1, fleet standard) so fnm/nvm select a working node\n- CLAUDE.md: document the requirement + the failure signature\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6789682664a4e2e2f77328d32fa7ece9bd65135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/d6789682664a4e2e2f77328d32fa7ece9bd65135"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/c7dcfb8f709bcaea06ae58ce0eb3ba3bd2005d5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"pu