file status x queue label merged into one displayed pipeline state\n  (queued/ready/available/claimed/delivered/merged/dropped) with\n  file-vs-queue drift flagged, never papered over\n\nReplaces the seeded editorial Delivery section (hardcoded Frame OS\nmilestones + next-moves in fleet-config) — exactly the synthesized\nfiller northstar P1 wants gone. /api/cockpit and the GraphQL contract\n(ADR-0013 drift gate) untouched. Renderer pane keeps the OJF editorial\nstyle: per-property gap bars, phase-grouped slice rows with state/gate/\ndrift chips, movement odometer (most recent first), 60s poll.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b7b96147798ea92275d937d4eebcf6e17988b46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/1b7b96147798ea92275d937d4eebcf6e17988b46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/197d41d39ba4cfba784016bedcd581587bca40ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbo