avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/6d7351609a0ff65cf1b4dceeb7d7b30a4c47a17e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T21:39:13Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T21:40:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(briefing): repo-scoped Briefing — the Fleet→Briefing focus-swap (F2)\n\nTrack F / Flow 01 / F2 (ADR-0012 #1,#2,#4 + ADR-0007). THE visible payoff:\nselecting a Fleet tile re-scopes Section 00''s Briefing to that repo.\n\nMechanism — scope the snapshot, reuse the generator (one code path, global vs scoped):\n- shared: scopeSnapshotToRepo(snapshot, repo) — pure lane filter by repo. Adds\n  BriefingSnapshot.repo (the G0 forward-declared seam is now BACKED → removed from the\n  SDL↔shared parity allowlist).\n- server: generateBriefing(_, _, repo?) scopes first + tags the result; REST\n  /api/briefing?repo= (cache keyed per repo); GraphQL briefing(repo:) passes it through.\n- renderer: fetchBriefing(repo); Briefing reads selectedRepo, refetches on change\n  (AbortController), shows an honest empty First Move for a quiet repo (never the prior\n  repo''s threads / no MOCK), and the caption shows the scoped repo.\n\nTruthful-empty + a bug the browser smoke caught: the LLM path validated threads against\nALL repos, so a quiet repo (lean-canvas) got 4 fabricated threads. Fixed two ways —\n(a) an empty scoped snapshot skips the LLM entirely (deterministic empty), and (b) when\nscoped, the model + emit-gate are constrained to that one repo. Now covered by a test that\ngenuinely exercises the LLM path (vi.hoisted mock).\n\nVerified in a browser (Playwright, live Dolt): toggled morning-cockpit → lean-canvas\n(honest empty) → core; Section 00 re-scoped each time.\n\nRecords ns:l1-morning-cockpit#P3 20→45 (the focus-swap works end-to-end).\n\nTests: shared 76 (+3 scope), server 26 (+3 generate), renderer 10 (+3 swap). typecheck +\nbuild clean. Read-only preserved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"df697fbd3bef259c827bd6655393198a9e40d57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/df697fbd3bef259c827bd6655393198a9e40d57d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/6d7351609a0ff65cf1b4dceeb7d7b30a4c47a17e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/6d7351609a0ff65cf1b4dceeb7d7b30a4c47a17e","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDZkNzM1MTYwOWEwZmY2NWNmMWI0ZGNlZWI3ZDdiMzBhNGM0N2ExN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e","sha":"8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e"}],"sha":"6d7351609a0ff65cf1b4dceeb7d7b30a4c47a17e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/6d7351609a0ff65cf1b4dceeb7d7b30a4c47a17e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T20:12:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T20:20:58Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(fleet): selection state — Fleet becomes a selector + extract RepoCardView (F1)\n\nTrack F / Flow 01 / F1 (ADR-0012 #1–#5). Renderer-only, read-only. Makes the Fleet\na selector: clicking a tile moves the highlight and persists; the Briefing is NOT\nchanged yet (that''s F2).\n\n- cockpitState: add selectedRepo to mc.cockpit.v1 (default morning-cockpit, fixed\n  home). Persists with the rest of the UI state; a pre-key blob falls back to default.\n- RepoCardView extracted from FleetSection into its own file — the stable seam L1\n  (tile links) and L3 (popover) graft onto. Now interactive + accessible:\n  role=button, tabIndex, aria-pressed, click + Enter/Space to select.\n- FleetSection wired as a selector (selected = selectedRepo === name); App passes\n  selectedRepo + onSelectRepo (same ui/setUi pattern as Briefing).\n- Highlight follows selection (not the static here flag); ★ stays the home marker.\n- Renderer test infra (first in the package): jsdom + @testing-library + vitest.config\n  (no @vitejs/plugin-react — vite5/6 type skew; esbuild handles TSX via jsx:react-jsx).\n\nTests: renderer 7 new (cockpitState 3, RepoCardView 3, FleetSection 1); server 23,\nshared 73 unchanged. typecheck + build clean. Briefing.tsx untouched (no swap yet).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"4a5890ca27a5124a93aa7867fbb0f1fb1be13518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/4a5890ca27a5124a93aa7867fbb0f1fb1be13518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDg1NzJjMzFhMDQ5NWQwMTU5YWJlZGQyYTFkMzZhOWFmNDdiY2UyOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/6a9de3353f033ecebb0a92f780b79ef3e170941f","sha":"6a9de3353f033ecebb0a92f780b79ef3e170941f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/6a9de3353f033ecebb0a92f780b79ef3e170941f"}],"sha":"8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8572c31a0495d0159abedd2a1d36a9af47bce29e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/6a9de3353f033ecebb0a92f780b79ef3e170941f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:13:25Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T15:16:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(graphql): read-model facade (yoga) over the G0 contract, beside REST (G1)\n\nTrack G / G1. Stands up a query-only GraphQL facade at /graphql serving the G0\ncontract — one shape for the UI and agents — with no new write path.\n\n- ReadModelSource port (schema/source.ts): resolvers depend on an interface, not\n  buildSnapshot/Dolt directly. The extraction seam for the eventual dedicated lean\n  graph service (core = logic, graph = thin) — re-back the source without touching\n  resolvers. Briefing generation lives behind the port too (LLM out of the resolver).\n- Resolvers (schema/resolvers.ts): fleet, briefing(repo: ignored→F2), workItems(lane),\n  agentLiveness. Enum case mapped at the boundary (UPPERCASE SDL ↔ lowercase shared).\n- Schema (schema/graph.ts): yoga createSchema over the vendored SDL — a transport-\n  agnostic GraphQLSchema, so the future standalone service hosts the SAME schema.\n- fleet-derive.ts: extracted deriveFleet/fleetTotals; routes/fleet.ts now calls it, so\n  REST and GraphQL parity is STRUCTURAL (one code path), not just asserted.\n- Mounted on Express before express.json() (yoga owns body parsing); GraphiQL dev-only.\n\nGates: C0 endpoint resolves; C1 fleet parity == REST (deriveFleet); C2 read-only\n(no Mutation; resolver/source import no write path) — proven by tests AND an HTTP\nsmoke (mutation rejected, /graphql + /api/fleet coexist on live Dolt).\n\nHonest gap: agentLiveness returns [] in the cockpit source impl (the dolt derivation\nisn''t exported yet) — port-shaped so the fill is a one-impl change; documented TODO.\n\nTests: server 23 (graph 2, facade-invariants 3), shared 73. G0 drift gates still green.\ntypecheck + build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"6aa28726b7ebfb5417e57b30d8c0c141e4b77f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/6aa28726b7ebfb5417e57b30d8c0c141e4b77f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/6a9de3353f033ecebb0a92f780b79ef3e170941f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h