 P3 10→20 — G0 read-model contract foundation shipped\n\nRecords movement on ns:l1-morning-cockpit#P3 (\"pivots focus across the active\nfleet\"): G0 landed (core#178 read-model SDL + cockpit#14 codegen + 3-part drift\ngate). Contract foundation in place; no user-facing focus-swap yet (that''s F2,\ngated by G1). northstar.md only — status.jsonl deferred until the three-tier\nnorthstar work defines its line schema.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"f748c926953673626b24611fd8c9c0df965fef6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/f748c926953673626b24611fd8c9c0df965fef6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/bc0be066a0b740d0724dbb5610f2f4ba9c2cd921","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/bc0be066a0b740d0724dbb5610f2f4ba9c2cd921","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKGJjMGJlMDY2YTBiNzQwZDA3MjRkYmI1NjEwZjJmNGJhOWMyY2Q5MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee","sha":"820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee"}],"sha":"bc0be066a0b740d0724dbb5610f2f4ba9c2cd921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/bc0be066a0b740d0724dbb5610f2f4ba9c2cd921"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T04:04:20Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T14:35:08Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(contract): codegen the read-model facade from core''s SDL + 3-part drift gate (G0)\n\nCockpit half of Track G / G0. Stacks on core#178 (@core/read-model-contract).\nThe facade''s TypeScript types are codegen''d from core''s canonical SDL — strict at\ncompile time (generated types) and run time (drift gates) — with NO runtime\ndependency on core and standalone deploy preserved (ADR-0013; ADR-0001 extended).\n\n- Vendor core''s SDL byte-identically into packages/server/src/schema/read-model.graphql\n  (+ .sha provenance); CI git-clones core to source it (ADR-0030 precedent).\n- @graphql-codegen typescript → src/schema/__generated__/read-model.ts (committed).\n- 3-part drift gate (a deliberate drift breaks CI, ADR-0013 C2):\n  1. SDL↔@cockpit/shared parity (parity.ts) — an SDL field with no shared backing is\n     flagged; forward-declared F2/L1/L3 seams (briefing repo, RepoCard links/popover)\n     are enumerated + excluded. Proven by a phantom-field red→green test.\n  2. vendored-parity (contract-check.ts) — vendored SDL must byte-equal core''s; plus a\n     query-only (no Mutation/Subscription) guard, proven by a mutation-bites test.\n  3. regenerate-diff — `contract:check` re-runs codegen + `git diff --exit-code`;\n     codegen is idempotent. `contract:sync` re-vendors from core.\n- New .github/workflows/ci.yml runs typecheck/build/test + the drift gates, cloning core.\n- research/G0-contract-spec.md (C0 gate); ADR-0013 records Q2 = package home.\n\nTests: server 18 (5 new schema tests), shared 73 — all green. typecheck + build clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"790b1523d559c9d6d3dc37ff753caaa856ac7f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/790b1523d559c9d6d3dc37ff753caaa856ac7f09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDgyMGU4ODc3ZTRjNzlkNzI5MzdhZWQzYjA4ZTM3NjJlYThlYjM2ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90","sha":"8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90"}],"sha":"820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/820e8877e4c79d72937aed3b08e3762ea8eb36ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-27T03:31:02Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-27T03:32:48Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs(dashboard-ux): land UX rollout docs + ADRs; codegen read-model contract (intake)\n\nLand the dashboard-ux Fleet→Briefing decomposition from\nclaude/dashboard-ux-flows-gr6l4e as pure additive docs (cherry-picked the\n5 doc files only — a branch merge would have reverted the shipped\nS2b/S3b/S4b/northstar work, since that branch forked before PRs #9–#12).\n\n- Renumber the fleet-selection ADR 0010 → 0012 (main''s real 0010 is\n  cockpit-triggers-core-queue-claim); fix all cross-refs across the 3\n  research docs + handoff prompts; 0011-graphql keeps its slot.\n- Resolve Track G integration after a stress-test: NOT a bare core import\n  (drags a write-engine + anthropic-sdk into a read-only app, needs\n  net-new publish infra, reintroduces version-skew drift). Instead a\n  core-authored canonical SDL, codegen''d into the cockpit facade —\n  strict at compile AND run time, no runtime core dependency, standalone\n  preserved.\n- ADR-0011 decision #1/#2 amended to the codegen mechanism.\n- New ADR-0013 captures the full architectural evolution + rationale.\n- ADR-0001 extended (not superseded): mirror-don''t-import + standalone\n  deploy preserved.\n\nAdditive-only: 7 doc files, zero code touched, zero deletions.\ntypecheck/build/test all green (86 tests).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Tud71dukYdZFz7ReUjdkMk","tree":{"sha":"21e2f43bdd8f9215b72faf06a66b511ff95a3983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/21e2f43bdd8f9215b72faf06a66b511ff95a3983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDhhY2I4ZDRjZGM1MzQzNGVlM2E4ZWZlODI3YWZhMmJkMTk0NGVlOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/203b2b3d8745227a54bd9989d31b97f751069b9d","sha":"203b2b3d8745227a54bd9989d31b97f751069b9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/203b2b3d8745227a54bd9989d31b97f751069b9d"}],"sha":"8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/8acb8d4cdc53434ee3a8efe827afa2bd1944ee90"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/203b2b3d8745227a54bd9989d31b97f751069b9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T20:53:08Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T21:27:27Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(northstar): morning-cockpit L1 northstar (first-cut, ladders to l2-ojfbot)\n\nPer-app L1 for the three-tier system (core PR #173). Three first-cut properties — legible\nmorning pane, real coordination, fleet focus-swap — laddering to l2-ojfbot P2/P1. Grounded\nin what the cockpit already is; to be refined against the northstar goals discussed in\nClaude Design.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KQap7GLuiso4RG165V8LUz","tree":{"sha":"555c421c6c86d6c9728ab6789ff68bdf6e020e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/555c421c6c86d6c9728ab6789ff68bdf6e020e85