,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/54b25d56257be810635848e21f2ed236046820df","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDU0YjI1ZDU2MjU3YmU4MTA2MzU4NDhlMjFmMmVkMjM2MDQ2ODIwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a","sha":"71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca","sha":"a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca"}],"sha":"54b25d56257be810635848e21f2ed236046820df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/54b25d56257be810635848e21f2ed236046820df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T03:03:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T03:03:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"docs: coordination-layer rollout — Control-Gated Slices plan + S1 spec\n\nThe depth extension deferred from the cockpit redesign v1 (ADR-0007), planned via\n/gated-slice and /plan-feature.\n- coordination-rollout-gated-slices.md: 6 vertical slices (event spine → liveness →\n  queue read → human claim → un-stub Briefing verbs → autonomous claim), each with\n  Control Gates + TPMs. The autonomous claim/dispatch control gets a Brassboard/shadow\n  stage with RIDM-gated promotion (M-falseclaim<5%, M-override<20%, M-lease=100%).\n- S1-event-spine-spec.md: implementation-ready spec for the bead_events writer\n  (emitEvent in core/bead-emit.mjs, single-DOLT_COMMIT invariant) + test matrix +\n  the Dolt-transaction open question.\n\nS1 is queued as a live brief in core/.handoff/. Plan only — no code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"060ab05b488864f22ef3284237ce59a87af4fb9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/060ab05b488864f22ef3284237ce59a87af4fb9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKGE5YzE1ZWYwYzg3NjRlZGE4MjgwNzZhYjE2NmMzZTQ3ODM1MjBjY2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/d97bba2324212f8ca167b422a0dbc034f458fadc","sha":"d97bba2324212f8ca167b422a0dbc034f458fadc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/d97bba2324212f8ca167b422a0dbc034f458fadc"}],"sha":"a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/a9c15ef0c8764eda828076ab166c3e4783520cca"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:32:57Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:32:57Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 6 — chat rail integration + responsive + a11y polish\n\nPHASES Phase 6. ADR-0006 chat untouched; just the rail chrome + global polish.\n- Chat rail: collapsed = 48px strip with the vertical \"▸ Ask the Chief of Staff\"\n  toggle; expanded = 372px editorial panel (warm-paper, sharp). Width transition.\n- Responsive: stacking breakpoint 1100→900px; stacked rail becomes a full-width\n  3px-ink-topped block. (Briefing band <880px + lanes <960px already single-col.)\n- A11y: global :focus-visible red ring (keyboard nav on the decision tree, thread\n  rail, branches, links, inputs); mouse clicks don''t trigger it.\n- Density: real DENSE/COZY toggle in the masthead → data-density (compact spacing\n  vars), persisted in mc.cockpit.v1 alongside theme.\n\nVerified: chat expand/collapse; density compact (--gap-section 40px) persists;\n600px → zero overflow, briefing + lanes single-col, chat stacked. typecheck (3) +\nbuild + 75 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38f8d3d1bcde2dd387176380b1b1db64c7f0dd5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/38f8d3d1bcde2dd387176380b1b1db64c7f0dd5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDcxZDVmOWM4MmY1NjRjYjM2MTQ0MWU0Y2E1ZjU3ZWNiMjY1YTYzNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/4580928f0caa7a7e8a3b740cd80e6ade31026537","sha":"4580928f0caa7a7e8a3b740cd80e6ade31026537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/4580928f0caa7a7e8a3b740cd80e6ade31026537"}],"sha":"71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/71d5f9c82f564cb361441e4ca5f57ecb265a636a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/4580928f0caa7a7e8a3b740cd80e6ade31026537/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:29:11Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:29:11Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 5 — Critical Path (02) blocker board\n\nPHASES Phase 4 (seeded mode): the 4-row blocker board from coordination-design §6.\n- shared/fleet.ts: Severity/CriticalChain/CriticalPathSnapshot.\n- server/fleet-config.ts: CRITICAL_CHAINS (the 4 hand-read chains) + intro + note;\n  GET /api/critical-path (seeded:true).\n- renderer CriticalPathSection: severity pills (CRITICAL/HIGH red, BLOCKED amber,\n  DECISION ink), blocks chips, impact counts, \"waits on\" note; \"Brief ↑\" sets the\n  Briefing active thread + smooth-scrolls to it (Section gains an id anchor;\n  Briefing is id=\"briefing\"). \"Settle first\" ghost CTA for the ADR row. Footer marks\n  the chains seeded until live repo-deps + bead refs are wired (the real §4 work).\n\nVerified vs screenshots/03-critical-path: 4 chains render; Brief ↑ jumps + scrolls\nto the Briefing (best-effort id match against generated threads). Department stack\nnow 00–06. typecheck + build + 75 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude 