thubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/2f772e7ad71b50b3749e22797ba7f67419ebe541/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:25:15Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:25:15Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 4 — Fleet (01) + Delivery (03) read-models\n\nPHASES Phase 3: the two data-driven coordination departments.\n- shared/fleet.ts: RepoCard/FleetSnapshot + DeliveryMilestone/NextMove/DeliverySnapshot.\n- server/fleet-config.ts: editorial repo metadata (role/phase) + the delivery phase\n  track + §6 next-moves (held as config the ADR owns — the doc is prose, not data).\n- server/routes/fleet.ts: GET /api/fleet merges the config repos with LIVE signals\n  derived from the snapshot (openCount, lastActivity, liveness); liveness is a\n  last-activity fallback (bead_events empty — §0), labelled as such in the caption.\n  GET /api/delivery serves the seeded track + moves.\n- renderer FleetSection (responsive repo-card grid, \"you are here\" morning-cockpit\n  variant) + DeliverySection (phase track w/ red progress line + numbered next-moves\n  with S/M/L effort badges). Wired as 01 + 03.\n\nVerified vs screenshots/02-fleet + 04-delivery: 16 repos, real open counts\n(core 10, shell 2), live/stale/dark from last-activity; delivery track + 6 moves.\ntypecheck + build + 75 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0d24b4bbf00ce76283eacd48348586b9bca0266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/c0d24b4bbf00ce76283eacd48348586b9bca0266"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/2f772e7ad71b50b3749e22797ba7f67419ebe541","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/2f772e7ad71b50b3749e22797ba7f67419ebe541","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKDJmNzcyZTdhZDcxYjUwYjM3NDllMjI3OTdiYTdmNjc0MTllYmU1NDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057","sha":"c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057"}],"sha":"2f772e7ad71b50b3749e22797ba7f67419ebe541","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/2f772e7ad71b50b3749e22797ba7f67419ebe541"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:20:35Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:20:35Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 3 — Chief-of-Staff briefing generator (replaces the mock)\n\nPHASES Phase 5 (read side) + ADR-0007. The Briefing''s threads are now a real\nread-model, generated and gated, with a deterministic floor:\n- shared/briefing.ts: briefingFallback(snapshot) — honest threads from real lane\n  data (most-stale first, real repos/ids), the always-present floor.\n- server/briefing-generate.ts: ground Ollama (qwen2.5:7b, ADR-0006 discipline) on\n  the snapshot → up to 4 threads, ONE recommended action each (flat schema for 7B\n  reliability) + a deterministic defer branch. Every artifact gated by\n  validateBriefDraft (repo must exist); invalid threads dropped; 0 survivors or any\n  failure → briefingFallback. No cloud cascade.\n- GET /api/briefing, cached by snapshot content (force=1 regenerates).\n- renderer: Briefing fetches the read-model (mock is the loading placeholder),\n  shows a source badge (✨ Chief of Staff / deterministic) + regenerate.\n- decisions/adr/0007: generator proposes, every emit stays human-approved (ADR-0005),\n  coexists with chat (ADR-0006), non-handoff verbs deferred to §6.\n\nVerified live: GET /api/briefing → source:llm, 4 threads grounded in real beads\n(bldgblog-corpus, OPAV S1, deliverable spine), all artifacts valid; UI renders them\nwith the badge. Fallback covered by unit test. typecheck + build + 75 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"edd2fdc5549f5bc1550ae78a9048a7131d347d89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/edd2fdc5549f5bc1550ae78a9048a7131d347d89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057","node_id":"C_kwDOS19ny9oAKGM4ZWIxMzU1YTkzMDVhMDRhMDBkYTJiODAxMWI2NTM3M2VlZDcwNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commit/ad81f34308666cbf1f0acaa5482987e2df86158f","sha":"ad81f34308666cbf1f0acaa5482987e2df86158f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/ad81f34308666cbf1f0acaa5482987e2df86158f"}],"sha":"c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/c8eb1355a9305a04a00da2b8011b65373eed7057"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/ad81f34308666cbf1f0acaa5482987e2df86158f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:13:22Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:13:22Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 2 — Briefing console (decision tree → Handoff Artifact)\n\nPHASES Phase 2 + the deliver-branch write (pulled from Phase 5, reusing ADR-0005):\n- shared/briefing.ts: BriefingThread/Branch/Artifact/Snapshot view-models +\n  artifactToCandidate() mapper onto the existing BriefCandidate/BriefBody shape.\n- server: emitArtifact() stages the pre-reviewed artifact and approves it through\n  the SAME gated write path as the chat (validate → path-guard → write, never\n  overwrite, never create a repo). POST /api/briefing/emit.\n- renderer components/briefing/: the two-column band (seeded thread rail with tag\n  pills + active highlight; Chief-of-Staff conversation: catch-up rule, decision\n  tree pre-selected on the recommended branch, branch reveals) + full-width\n  composer. Handoff Artifact card draft → Approve & emit → green EMITTED + Undo.\n  defer/archive + the selfco repo-scaffold branch render honestly disabled with a\n  \"verb not built (§6)\" affordance. UI state (activeId/chosen/approved) is local +\n  persisted in mc.cockpit.v1; threads are a typed mock (Slice 3 swaps to fetch).\n\nVerified vs screenshots/01-briefing: a deliver Approve writes a real, orient-\ncompatible brief into core/.handoff/ (confirmed on disk, then removed); EMITTED +\nUndo work; defer shows the disabled §6 affordance. typecheck + build + 71 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c9c515086e4a0c404f618c28387566e69b207fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/8c9c515086e4a0c404f618c28387566e69b207fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/commits/ad81f34308666cbf1f0acaa5482987e2df86158f","verification":{"