l_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/bcb3495f06f8b54881410b27fdc31dc7dfb1884d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:04:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T02:04:26Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Slice 1 — restyle existing pods to OJF Editorial\n\nPHASES Phase 1: Beads / Reading / Research now render from live data in the new\neditorial language. No data changes — pure presentation.\n- Section: numbered editorial header (mono red kicker \"04 — WORK\" + big headline\n  + two-line mono caption + 3px ink rule), replacing the rounded .panel bubble.\n  Beads=04 WORK, Reading=05 INTEL, Research=06 SIGNAL.\n- Lanes: red rules, mono counts + captions; cards are sharp/hairline with a\n  severity left-border by status (stale=amber, failed/open=red, running=green),\n  mono kind tags + status dots, stale badges.\n- Lane/digest brief: headline → square bullets → red pull-quote action line.\n- Reading: magazine contents index — dotted leaders (title ···· time) per item.\n- All radii zeroed, no icons/images — type, rules, coloured dots only.\n\nVerified light + dark against live /api/cockpit, /api/reading, /api/papers;\nmatches screenshots/05-beads + 06-reading. typecheck + build + 13 tests green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"