s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/commits/5bf058c19ca9e98a7363e7b1ca9ba88b561b4aeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T01:53:12Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T01:53:12Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"Fix horizontal overflow: chat rail defaults collapsed + overflow guard\n\nUser feedback (responsive broke): the 380px chat panel was open by default and\nate the side-by-side width band. Per the design the rail is \"default collapsed\"\n(an open line, not a panel).\n- ChatSidebar.initialOpen() → false (collapsed 48px strip by default).\n- html, body { max-width:100%; overflow-x:hidden } — hard guard so a stray wide\n  child clips instead of spilling the page into a horizontal scroll.\n\nVerified zero overflow 980→1440px; collapsed rail renders, main content full width.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ace73ba2f0b182a5661ba22c4ef860571136023e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/morning-cockpit/git/trees/ace73ba2f0b182a5661ba22