tions test, tRPC test, Playwright E2E\n  - fullstack/04_deployment: Docker multi-stage, Turborepo prune, Vercel, migration strategy\n\nBackend system design (1 file):\n  - 29_cqrs_event_sourcing: Command/Query split, Event Store, Aggregate, Projector, Snapshot\n\nNode.js OOD problems (3 files):\n  - 24_job_queue: priority queue, retry with backoff, BullMQ comparison\n  - 25_middleware_pipeline: compose (onion model), async chain, error middleware\n  - 26_connection_pool: acquire/release, wait queue, leak detection, PgBouncer","tree":{"sha":"b81221946907d2be0395a349d18b4c8465299e64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/trees/b81221946907d2be0395a349d18b4c8465299e64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/commits/06329ac54bf23acd03eab935657318673d977b37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47088575?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FleetingEcho","id":47088575,"login":"FleetingEcho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDg4NTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/FleetingEcho/system-design/commit/06329ac54bf23