e":"Teng Zhang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T06:38:29Z","email":"jakeottawaca@gmail.com","name":"Teng Zhang"},"message":"feat: add 9 OOD files — ATM/Snake/TicTacToe/Cinema/LFU + TS advanced/anti-patterns/GRASP/UML\n\n08_ood:\n  - 18_atm_machine: State pattern (Idle/CardInserted/PINVerified/Dispensing), WAL recovery\n  - 19_snake_game: Queue-based body, O(1) HashSet collision detection, tail-exclusion edge case\n  - 20_tic_tac_toe: NxN board, O(1) win detection via row/col/diagonal counters, Minimax AI stub\n  - 21_cinema_booking: 2D seat map, CAS optimistic lock anti-oversell, timeout release strategies\n  - 22_lfu_cache: Double HashMap + LinkedHashSet, minFreq invariant, O(1) all ops, LRU tiebreaker\n\n09_ood_guide:\n  - 10_typescript_advanced: Discriminated unions, mapped types, infer, template literal types, keyof/typeof\n  - 11_anti_patterns: God Class, Anemic Domain Model, Primitive Obsession, Feature Envy, Shotgun Surgery\n  - 12_grasp: All 9 GRASP principles with TypeScript examples and SOLID comparison table\n  - 13_uml_cheatsheet: 6 relationship types, multiplicity, whiteboard tips, code→UML lookup table\n\nREADME: 91 → 100 files, added 09_ood_guide entries 10-13","tree":{"sha":"c6829d17783e49c2565c554702929193b30646f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/trees/c6829d17783e49c2565c554702929193b30646f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/commits/7e7626d330a1468b6c190367cfd0a92efe31516f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47088575?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_