s://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/commits/db2c0b1c76b650ac3cfcc07d358d497dbd42292a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T06:25:03Z","email":"jakeottawaca@gmail.com","name":"Teng Zhang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T06:25:03Z","email":"jakeottawaca@gmail.com","name":"Teng Zhang"},"message":"feat: add 09_ood_guide — systematic OOD tutorial in TypeScript (10 files)\n\nFundamentals (01-04):\n- 01_encapsulation: access modifiers, invariant protection, getter/setter best practices\n- 02_abstraction: interface vs abstract class decision tree, abstraction levels\n- 03_inheritance: fragile base class, composition over inheritance, Square-Rectangle trap, Mixin\n- 04_polymorphism: subtype/parametric/ad-hoc polymorphism, generics, duck typing\n\nDesign principles (05):\n- 05_solid: all 5 SOLID principles with TypeScript counter-examples and corrections\n\nDesign patterns (06-08):\n- 06_creational: Factory Method, Abstract Factory, Builder (fluent API), Singleton, Prototype\n- 07_structural: Composite, Decorator (stacking), Adapter, Facade, Proxy (lazy/cache/auth)\n- 08_behavioral: Strategy, Observer, State, Command (Undo/Redo), CoR, Template Method\n\nInterview guide (09):\n- 09_interview_guide: 45-min time allocation, requirement clarification script,\n  extensibility discussion, pattern selection decision tree, problem difficulty tiers","tree":{"sha":"b3dc53c3ad77cde41c90c7b67917534cb59e9ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/trees/b3dc53c3ad77cde41c90c7b67917534cb59e9ae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/commits/db2c0b1c76b650ac3cfcc07d358d497dbd42292a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatur