ion Hierarchies, GPS probe pipeline\n- 23_distributed_mq: Kafka design, Commit Log, zero-copy, ISR replicas, consumer group rebalance\n- 24_metrics_monitoring: Pull/Push models, TSDB schema, Gorilla compression, alert state machine\n- 25_distributed_email: SMTP flow, SPF/DKIM/DMARC, bounce handling, open tracking pixel\n- 26_gaming_leaderboard: Redis ZSet, Top-100 cache, sharded ZSet, friend leaderboard fanout\n- 27_digital_wallet: double-entry bookkeeping, idempotent transfer, local outbox pattern, reconciliation\n\nNew fundamentals:\n- 09_consistent_hashing: hash ring, virtual nodes math, TypeScript implementation, vs range sharding","tree":{"sha":"1302c6d1cc7caa446da53f2a36152a6fa4d9f021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/trees/1302c6d1cc7caa446da53f2a36152a6fa4d9f021"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FleetingEcho/system-design/git/commits/54b86bee2a15180149cb906fe239687133196886","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47088575?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/FleetingEcho","id":47088575,"login":"FleetingEcho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDg4NTc1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/FleetingEcho/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fleetin