:135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/7c6f31165628a843502535a73c10996bdeb5d7e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:12:56Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:12:56Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"docs: add the CS 6180 final report, whose figures are not generated\n\nThe report for the course submission, in three forms: the Markdown\nsource, the Word document edited from it, and the PDF exported from\nthat. The .docx is the authority -- the copy-editing pass happened\nthere -- and the .md was regenerated from it afterwards, so the two\nround-trip to identical text.\n\nThe thing a later reader needs to know: **every figure in this report\nwas carried across by hand.** `sync_eval_artifacts.py` has an explicit\nthree-entry DOC_TARGETS list (scripts/sync_eval_artifacts.py:52-56) and\nthis file is not in it, so `make check` will not notice if the recorded\nrun changes underneath it. That is the drift `Honesty_Constraints.md`\n§11 exists to prevent, tolerated here only because the artifact leaves\nthe repository for a submission and cannot carry generation markers.\n\nRe-run the evaluation and this report is stale with nothing to say so.\nIt quotes results/eval-h1-repeat3-2026-07-31/ throughout.\n\nEvery figure carries the qualification the ledger in\ndocs/interview/DCODE_TECH_BRIEF.md §4 requires it to carry, and none of\nthe eighteen entries on that document''s §4.9 no-quote list appears.","tree":{"sha":"2656ec4869a6bce7d1e05f7e0693a765103e2275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/2656ec4869a6bce7d1e05f7e0693a765103e2275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/7c6f31165628a843502535a73c10996bdeb5d7e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/7c6f31165628a843502535a73c10996bdeb5d7e0","node_id":"C_kwDOS2E-LtoAKDdjNmYzMTE2NTYyOGE4NDM1MDI1MzVhNzNjMTA5OTZiZGViNWQ3ZTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/9e2bed22bd4d11b883b72e98ab9d13550ad5b1d6","sha":"9e2bed22bd4d11b883b72e98ab9d13550ad5b1d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/9e2bed22bd4d11b883b72e98ab9d13550ad5b1d6"}],"sha":"7c6f31165628a843502535a73c10996bdeb5d7e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/7c6f31165628a843502535a73c10996bdeb5d7e0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/9e2bed22bd4d11b883b72e98ab9d13550ad5b1d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:11:50Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:11:50Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"chore: ignore Office lock files\n\nWord leaves a ~$-prefixed lock file beside an open document. One was\nsitting in the repository root and would have been picked up by\n`git add -A`; nothing in .gitignore covered the pattern.","tree":{"sha":"cd8c99cecbd80188e3c0fd6a1986e8921022f1fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/cd8c99cecbd80188e3c0fd6a1986e8921022f1fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/9e2bed22bd4d11b883b72e98ab9d13550ad5b1d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht