204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d","sha":"80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d","sha":"02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d"}],"sha":"6875101573d406f713e2b9fc2f635c3195422032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/6875101573d406f713e2b9fc2f635c3195422032"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T20:47:26Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T20:47:26Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"fix(deploy): make the images self-contained instead of installing at start\n\nThe first Railway deploy of `api` spent twelve minutes and then failed with\n`error: Failed to spawn: alembic`. Two causes, both invisible locally.\n\n`uv sync --no-dev` at the workspace root syncs the ROOT project, not the\nmembers. The root pyproject declares no dependencies, so that build step\ninstalled nothing — the local images have two entries in site-packages and\nno alembic. Everything was really being installed by `uv run` at container\nstart, every start. `--package dcode-api` (and the equivalent for worker and\nagent) makes the build actually produce a usable environment.\n\nThen `uv run` re-syncs at start, and without --no-dev it pulls the dev\ngroup: the deploy log shows it downloading mypy, ruff and pygments before\ndoing anything. That is where the twelve minutes went, on a loop, and it\nstill could not find alembic because the preDeployCommand ran before any of\nthis had a chance to help.\n\nSo every entrypoint now calls the venv binary directly and `uv run` is gone\nfrom infra/ entirely. apps/embedding already did exactly this, with a\ncomment saying \"avoid `uv run` reinstalling packages on restart\" — the\nlesson was learned in one image and not the other four.\n\nVerified rather than assumed. My first diagnosis was that the workspace sync\nwas dragging in torch from the two model sidecars; that was wrong — the old\nimages contain no torch, because the sync was a no-op. The build log settled\nit: `Resolved 109 packages in 774ms`, `Checked in 1ms`, and the twelve\nminutes were in the deploy phase.\n\nWhat is now verified: the api image runs alembic and uvicorn with\n`--network none` in under a second, where the old one could not run at all\nwithout downloading first; all four images build; the local compose stack\nstill comes up healthy with uvicorn as PID 1, and /readyz reports all three\nchecks green.\n\nAlso the first actual run of the combined agent-worker entrypoint, which had\nnever been executed anywhere. Both children start and the worker retries its\nbroker. On Railway it exited with \"a child exited with 1; stopping the\nother\" when RabbitMQ was unreachable — which is the designed behaviour\nworking, not a bug: a dead worker takes the container down instead of\nleaving one that answers questions while every submitted repository sits in\n`queued` forever.","tree":{"sha":"8a1cbcb3120684f54620d79f9c5f538cfa713f56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/8a1cbcb3120684f54620d79f9c5f538cfa713f56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d","node_id":"C_kwDOS2E-LtoAKDAyZWQ5YWFhYWFmMTJiMTE1YzI4MjViM2U1YjVlOGU3N2ZjOTI1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d","sha":"80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d"}],"sha":"02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/02ed9aaaaaf12b115c2825b3e5b5e8e77fc9257d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/80cd204508e496c653bc29754939b9baabccc17d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T20:21:12Z","email":"135147367+Odiethebest@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Odie Yang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T20:21:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #23 from Odiethebest/fix/audit-followups\n\nfix: the audit follow-ups, and the three limits that remain","tree":{"sha":"5e1a32ad768057fa8ec670891fd95acad8d41d53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/5e1a32ad768057fa8ec670891fd95acad8d41d53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/80cd204508e496c653bc29754939