:"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/0e731f5404d35fd859c070346f6e96a042900707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:56:31Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:56:31Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"eval: point the generator at the current run\n\nDEFAULT_RUN moves to results/eval-h1-l3x12-2026-07-31, which regenerates\nevalSnapshot.ts and the marker-delimited blocks in README and both\nFinal_Report files. No figure is typed; make check fails on drift.\n\nThe docstring''s example of a legitimate qualitative prose claim was \"the\ngraph''s contribution is unmeasured\". That example is now false, which is\na small demonstration of the thing the docstring is warning about: the\ndrift check guards figures, and a sentence can rot while every number\naround it stays correct.","tree":{"sha":"e7924dd21e25c5cc56b24b51d33ff760add56b94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/e7924dd21e25c5cc56b24b51d33ff760add56b94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/0e731f5404d35fd859c070346f6e96a042900707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/0e731f5404d35fd859c070346f6e96a042900707","node_id":"C_kwDOS2E-LtoAKDBlNzMxZjU0MDRkMzVmZDg1OWMwNzAzNDZmNmU5NmEwNDI5MDA3MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6","sha":"eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6"}],"sha":"0e731f5404d35fd859c070346f6e96a042900707","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/0e731f5404d35fd859c070346f6e96a042900707"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:56:16Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:56:16Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"eval: record the L3-expanded H1 run\n\nThe complete B1-B4 real-model run on the frozen 33-question suite, under\nscoring protocol final_verified_evidence_v1 with B3 and B4 sharing one\nagent synthesis path. Same index, same commit, same index_revision as the\n2026-07-30 run, so the only differences are the question set and the\nprotocol.\n\nVerdict, verbatim: unsupported. L2 cleared against both rivals (+0.217 vs\nB2, +0.083 vs B3); L3 missed by 0.005 (+0.097 vs B2, +0.045 vs B3).\n\nThree things this run establishes that no previous one could, all recorded\nin provenance.json rather than left for a reader to derive:\n\nThe verdict is protocol-sensitive. B2/B3 are scored on retrieved top-k and\nB4 on verified final evidence. Applying B4''s rule to B3 as well -- a scoring\nthe harness already computes -- gives +0.057 on L2 and +0.051 on L3, which\nclears both. The pre-registered rule is the verdict; the alternative is\npublished beside it. Choosing it after seeing that it flips the outcome is\nnot an option that exists.\n\nThe pre-registered justification for that asymmetry was falsified. It was\nargued as a deliberate handicap because B4''s evidence set is smaller than\nfive. B4''s final evidence outscored its own candidate top-5 on every\nretrieval metric (recall 0.448 vs 0.401, MRR 0.763 vs 0.634), so the rule\nhelped B4.\n\nThe call graph''s own contribution is small and, for the first time,\ncounted rather than inferred: 4 new ground-truth hits across 3 of 33\nquestions. B4''s margin over B3 therefore cannot be attributed to the graph.\n\nAn earlier attempt at this run was aborted during B3 and its partial output\ndeleted, because Redis still held agent tool-result entries written before\nthe current agent code existed. Cache flushed, suite rerun from B1.","tree":{"sha":"5643e6b2c6d601232278ed28634750a448f45f03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/5643e6b2c6d601232278ed28634750a448f45f03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6","node_id":"C_kwDOS2E-LtoAKGViM2RmMzFhNDhiMDhlYjVhZDNiYWU2MGVhYzNhNDU4YzIyOTk3ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7","sha":"ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7"}],"sha":"eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/eb3df31a48b08eb5ad3bae60eac3a458c22997e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:19:03Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T08:19:03Z","email":"520yangziqi@gmail.com","name":"odieyang"},"message":"eval: expand L3 from 3 to 12 and freeze the suite\n\nPre-registration for the next graph-sensitive H1 run. 17 questions added\n(8 cross-file L2, 9 architecture L3), so the suite is now L1=5 / L2=16 /\nL3=12 = 33. Nothing removed: the three pre-existing L2/L3 pairs whose GT\noverlaps (1.00 / 0.75 / 0.50) stay put, because the fix is to dilute their\nweight, not to delete a measurement.\n\nFrozen before any baseline ran:\n  questions.jsonl sha256 db813124a72d85abd66a4dc248de94e6a147b46c3364271d51ddc772d0a28b45\n\nEvery anchor was verified to resolve 1:1 against the live psf/requests\nindex 2543893e with the resolver alone -- no B3/B4 was executed, so no\nnumber influenced a question. GT is gt_targets only; index-specific chunk\nuuids are never hard-coded, so the batch survives a re-index.\n\nsource=graph_reverse records that these were reverse-constructed from the\nindexed call relationships and source of the current corpus. That label is\ndeliberate: a suite built from the graph the system produced cannot contain\na flow that graph misses, so the documented blind spots (no type inference,\nunresolved inherited self.method() calls) are absent by construction, which\nfavours B4. The bias is recorded, not corrected.\n\nTwo properties accepted before the run rather than discovered after it:\n7 GT chunks are 2-5 line exception declarations that dense retrieval will\nlikely miss for every arm, and the Response class chunk behind q-023/q-028\nis 453 lines, large enough for lexical retrieval to hit on almost any\nrelated term.\n\nMax pairwise GT overlap inside the batch is 0.33, and 0.33 against the\noriginal 16.","tree":{"sha":"aeac5b0422cbb559800007d05772f61bd89d9c36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/trees/aeac5b0422cbb559800007d05772f61bd89d9c36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/git/commits/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest","id":135147367,"login":"Odiethebest","node_id":"U_kgDOCA4vZw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7","node_id":"C_kwDOS2E-LtoAKGFlNDc0MTk1ZWUwNTkzNDA4YWQ4NmJjZDBiOGZiMGQ4OTIwYjMxZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Odiethebest/Dcode/commit/80dad862ca51ac4165e4ee0c0e7496400e1a947e","sha":"80dad862ca51ac4165e4ee0c0e7496400e1a947e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/80dad862ca51ac4165e4ee0c0e7496400e1a947e"}],"sha":"ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Odiethebest/Dcode/commits/ae474195ee0593408ad86bcd0b8fb0d8920b31e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/135147367?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Odiethebest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g