om/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commits/2af0d4b662eba95a43f6e4ca1521a0f2c38174cd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T08:16:52Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T08:16:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build(deps): bump bedrock-agentcore to 1.18.1 with aligned boto3 across agent images (#15)\n\nbedrock-agentcore 1.18.1 requires boto3>=1.43.31, so the repo''s boto3 pin moves to 1.43.67 in the same change.\nPins are applied to all three agent images (frontend, orchestrator, worker) to keep versions consistent, per the pinning rationale in the requirements files.\n\nVerified on a deployed stack: all agent runtimes READY, gateway targets synced, and an end-to-end SigV4 agent invoke returning live tool data.","tree":{"sha":"eb805dae591292d42748440b242b22fd7d31d16b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/git/trees/eb805dae591292d42748440b242b22fd7d31d16b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/git/commits/2af0d4b662eba95a43f6e4ca1521a0f2c38174cd","verification":{"payload":"tree eb805dae591292d42748440b242b22fd7d31d16b\nparent d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786263412 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786263412 +0800\n\nbuild(deps): bump bedrock-agentcore to 1.18.1 with aligned boto3 across agent images (#15)\n\nbedrock-agentcore 1.18.1 requires boto3>=1.43.31, so the repo''s boto3 pin moves to 1.43.67 in the same change.\nPins are applied to all three agent images (frontend, orchestrator, worker) to keep versions consistent, per the pinning rationale in the requirements files.\n\nVerified on a deployed stack: all agent runtimes READY, gateway targets synced, and an end-to-end SigV4 agent invoke returning live tool data.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeDd0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAw9UQAFKTlfV04AoU3s6W6jWD5NFt\nqxbs6aK4qAUA2WBQv2jsiFbxLhYI5Owxd7t3gbaFqGWVhzhFgC9vThxDtXXNkb8V\ngW8NGSIawDh5f71RzsDMVDc0vmVvxLqRCPug7rd8j4pGwrul1GyZKOoYDglMHfny\n+Y/s+5c2EfH0ZXTMTYEC8CrsD8s4iqrinTQAxneA03zLLkiM2outcG5O3Siz2c+z\nhgyznNqrqTQOC8I9RrnTFV9HheHTerSm/84hZX+TRn4o9L6PoWpXKxNN60/993pZ\nq6bAxriUclzU7sUZD6dl+78/hLOSgK0zMsnAIhQOH+GTlM11VoHOWbyICMLqWQ13\nrG/OezuTPZmYKO+vpPzEq87lQeKDrj4zSHgMxVlGt3nmMi6zBTr3Ha7efJtXuzKk\nDF1WcXT4Zz6nRA7zzBtsKJtc3zrZrw21No4gZPpGz4vaPGD/vVH6L/R6neP27EQC\nwQjSj17UIWNSkjdJPJ+DC8GdaQ67tFhQnXtpBd9/zsyCp+C44L6S2OCWulrWeBnp\nXy0ZaqRsJbW1nnBtcruSCzKnjXA227JqyG3FWY4lwo+LZIk+mllNcb/bMK8egjRv\nDIK5/5eP5ErbqdkAjSLqkljoLDv12Zqi3pUIOHVK8wZFvnqE/m0n0502+62wXM+g\n4JLQV4qOBqWZR28BI5Uu\n=q5Ic\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-09T08:17:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commit/2af0d4b662eba95a43f6e4ca1521a0f2c38174cd","node_id":"C_kwDOS2FF8NoAKDJhZjBkNGI2NjJlYmE5NWE0M2Y2ZTRjYTE1MjFhMGYyYzM4MTc0Y2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commit/d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2","sha":"d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commits/d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2"}],"sha":"2af0d4b662eba95a43f6e4ca1521a0f2c38174cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commits/2af0d4b662eba95a43f6e4ca1521a0f2c38174cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/commits/d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:43:50Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T07:43:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"build(deps): next 16.3.0 + postcss 8.5.23, with Next 16 compatibility fixes (#17)\n\nSecurity bump for the frontend: postcss 8.5.8 -> 8.5.23 (source-map loading fix) and next 15.5.13 -> 16.3.0 (fixes CVE-2025-13465 in Next''s vendored lodash).\n\nNext 16 is a major upgrade, so this also carries the changes needed to run on it:\n- Apply Next 16''s mandatory config migrations (tsconfig.json jsx setting, next-env.d.ts references) so builds don''t rewrite them as dirty files.\n- Dedupe the OIDC token exchange: Next 16''s dev server enables React StrictMode, which double-mounts effects, so the auth callback ran twice with the same one-time authorization code — the second exchange got a 400 and restarted login, looping forever at \"Authenticating...\". The exchange is now memoized per code.\n\nVerified: tsc + production static export pass, and a real login + streamed chat turn against a deployed stack, with token-endpoint traffic confirming a single exchange per code.","tree":{"sha":"225d4ca1c564d71d302d9aabfc326f42f0f390cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/git/trees/225d4ca1c564d71d302d9aabfc326f42f0f390cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aws-samples/sample-cloudops-multi-agent-system/git/commits/d3f877db08756e187437ef85b3135d796dccdcc2","verification":{"payload":"tree 225d4ca1c564d71d302d9aabfc326f42f0f390cb\nparent ff0007a87bd076f5c83f062349ab817c4d137fd6\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1786261430 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786261430 +0800\n\nbuild(deps): next 16.3.0 + postcss 8.5.23, with Next 16 compatibility fixes (#17)\n\nSecurity bump for the frontend: postcss 8.5.8 -> 8.5.23 (source-map loading fix) and next 15.5.13 -> 16.3.0 (fixes CVE-2025-13465 in Next''s vendored lodash).\n\nNext 16 is a major upgrade, so this also carries the changes needed to run on it:\n- Apply Next 16''s mandatory config migrations (tsconfig.json jsx setting, next-env.d.ts references) so builds don''t rewrite them as dirty files.\n- Dedupe the OIDC token exchange: Next 16''s dev server enables React StrictMode, which double-mounts effects, so the auth callback ran twice with the same one-time authorization code — the second exchange got a 400 and restarted login, looping forever at \"Authenticating...\". The exchange is now memoized per code.\n\nVerified: tsc + production static export pass, and a real login + streamed chat turn against a deployed stack, with token-endpoint traffic confirming a single exchange per code.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeC+2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFKoQAF8wKIjTaE0xr+CN1hGhl2r3\nbY2jaDNXOEVBIH1pVK9122aIpDl7EO7IDu/ucPt58pSkeNNt/PTD/T1AlQ98SIKE\n9B22v89oWvrdLWMDXJZA588e5xhmnpujZefgUZTERn3exYQY4sx5EXXJU7DlYeWv\nvn7tiKTrr6xeSG6F38ojU2hMHsZBPFFk0FzKELYd7lRrQdD7mzTY6ltzpaBwSp7s\nSxUEx4Uy7CNA9nu3gBXbbWjkuKX9J5wjY8c4nn6JdlijvvSBP3+fGY9L2K26huWQ\nVr3qRLCQIsulRgWSKApdIPv54