Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"satyamyadav","providerType":"User"},"email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:22:45.532Z","repositoryId":1264718438,"sha":"1abc74a3426d3bd5c47cbee51add86f30c47d603"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"satyamyadav","providerType":"User"},"email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-23T22:22:33Z","committedDate":"2026-06-23T22:22:33Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"satyamyadav","providerType":"User"},"email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:22:45.532Z","repositoryId":1264718438,"sha":"aeb681c101f30ef2877e7d40c4ba5dc111bdb5e0"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"satyamyadav","providerType":"User"},"email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"authoredDate":"2026-06-23T22:19:04Z","committedDate":"2026-06-23T22:19:04Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"satyamyadav","providerType":"User"},"email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:22:45.532Z","repositoryId":1264718438,"sha":"a400b89eabd9da30dd8bfeaeea717fc724e168ba"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:22:45.532Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/5495c74f9c107afebc6b22b389e9109477c1f588/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:46:12Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T17:46:12Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"site: redesign — \"workbench\" identity, app-window hero, tour flow, video last\n\nReflow and re-skin the landing page around the product itself instead of a\nheadline-over-video.\n\nFlow (per the new brief):\n- Hero is the COMPLETE app window rendered in HTML — sidebar, a chat that\n  resolves a tool call + thinking + reply into a donut + table artifact, and the\n  canvas — set on a faint \"desk\" grid. The product is the argument; copy is one\n  line.\n- A \"tour\" then walks features one panel at a time (providers, consent,\n  artifacts, sessions, finance app), each a single real slice of the UI beside a\n  tight claim — no meta-narration about \"the actual interface, poke at it\".\n- The recorded video moves to the END (\"in motion\"), framed in app chrome, above\n  the closing download CTA.\n\nIdentity: drop the generic dark-purple SaaS gradient for a warm near-black\n\"workbench\". IBM Plex Mono is the chrome voice (labels, eyebrows, the app''s own\nUI); Inter carries the few real headlines. Accent colors carry MEANING only —\nsignal-green for done/allowed/local/positive, wire-blue for data/live/charts —\nnever decoration. Mono keyword eyebrows (providers/consent/artifacts…) encode\nwhat each feature is rather than decorative 01/02/03 numbering.\n\nMotion stays restrained: IntersectionObserver reveals + count-ups + a donut/bar\ndraw, all gated to on-screen and frozen under prefers-reduced-motion. One\ninteractive bit kept: the provider switcher (click or auto-cycle).\n\nVerified: pnpm build clean; hero, tour, video-last and the close render as\nintended at 1280px and 390px; header no longer clips on mobile; zero console\nerrors.","tree":{"sha":"696973e18469276bc79361df8f7905940f40aa8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/696973e18469276bc79361df8f7905940f40aa8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/5495c74f9c107afebc6b22b389e9109477c1f588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/5495c74f9c107afebc6b22b389e9109477c1f588","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDU0OTVjNzRmOWMxMDdhZmViYzZiMjJiMzg5ZTkxMDk0NzdjMWY1ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949","sha":"6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949"}],"sha":"5495c74f9c107afebc6b22b389e9109477c1f588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/5495c74f9c107afebc6b22b389e9109477c1f588"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:16:54Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:16:54Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"fix(desktop): write project config to an OS-writable app-data dir (macOS read-only FS)\n\nA packaged macOS `.app` launches with CWD `/` (read-only), so every write to the\nCWD-relative `.zanto/settings.json` failed with \"read-only file system\" — the\nuser saw it when saving provider config (set_config) and selecting a directory\n(add_allowed_path / set_project_dir).\n\nGive the project config a resolvable base dir in zanto-core::config:\n- add a process-global OnceLock override (set_project_config_base) + a\n  project_config_path() resolver; unset → the CWD-relative default, so the CLI\n  is byte-identical.\n- route all four sites (load, save, persist_allowed_path, ensure_project_config)\n  through the resolver.\n- add default_desktop_config_base() → ProjectDirs \"zanto\" data_dir (the same\n  OS-writable root already used for zanto.db/skills/artifacts).\n\nDesktop sets the base once at startup, before the first Settings::load(), and\nits direct load_project_settings() read now goes through project_config_path()\ntoo. Config lands at <app-data>/.zanto/settings.json (macOS\n~/Library/Application Support/zanto, Linux ~/.local/share/zanto).\n\nVerified: cargo build all crates; 138 core tests pass (2 new — CLI stays\nCWD-relative, desktop base resolves under a zanto data dir); CLI run in a temp\ndir still writes ./.zanto/settings.json. The final packaged-.app EROFS check\nhappens on macOS / via the release build. Spec archived.","tree":{"sha":"6af1ce2bc78122c1719453c861daa12af5038b81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/6af1ce2bc78122c1719453c861daa12af5038b81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDZlOTJhOTlkYTA2MDdiMjVkOWNiZTU3MmE2MzU1Nzk1MGY5NTM5NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028","sha":"fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028"}],"sha":"6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/6e92a99da0607b25d9cbe572a63557950f953949"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:10:22Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T12:10:22Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"site: interactive feature walkthrough — animated live mockups per feature\n\nReplace the static 6-card feature grid with a scroll-driven walkthrough where\neach feature renders its actual interface as a real-DOM mockup that animates\nitself into view. Auto-play + light interaction, zero new dependencies (pure\nHTML/CSS + one tiny inline vanilla script), GitHub-Pages-safe.\n\nSix demos:\n1. Chat → artifacts — user line types with a caret, reply streams, a bar chart\n   draws itself on the side canvas.\n2. Providers — model/provider switcher; auto-cycles Anthropic→…→Ollama and the\n   current-model line updates; click a chip to select it.\n3. Tools with consent — a permission prompt slides up (Allow/Deny/Always), then\n   a write-confirmation toast; tool chips (read/shell/web/edit/docs).\n4. Artifacts — metric counts up, category donut sweeps (conic-gradient), a\n   table fills row by row.\n5. Sessions — SQLite-backed list with a pulsing \"live\" resumed row and a\n   \"summarized\" badge.\n6. Personal finance — dashboard mock: safe-to-spend counts up, cashflow bars\n   grow, and clicking \"Auto-categorize\" moves SPOTIFY USA from uncategorized to\n   subscriptions with a highlight.\n\nMechanics: an IntersectionObserver toggles `.in-view` so CSS keyframes/\ntransitions only run on screen; count-ups are a small easeOutCubic JS tween;\neverything freezes to its final state under prefers-reduced-motion. Hero video,\nprovider strip, and privacy band retained.\n\nVerified: pnpm build clean; all six demos animate and both interactive bits\n(provider select, auto-categorize) work in preview with zero console errors.","tree":{"sha":"2fa909874c8e7168eb685b6149762596fd91a008","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/2fa909874c8e7168eb685b6149762596fd91a008"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKGZhYzY2NzFkYTYwZDUwOTkwMWM2Yjg4Nzk5MWRkNjA1ZjNmMjgwMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/8de860858481e44ab1854ab08f3d868fbd302da0","sha":"8de860858481e44ab1854ab08f3d868fbd302da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/8de860858481e44ab1854ab08f3d868fbd302da0"}],"sha":"fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/fac6671da60d509901c6b887991dd605f3f28028"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/8de860858481e44ab1854ab08f3d868fbd302da0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T21:33:35Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T21:33:35Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"fix(finance): resolve 7 review findings (transfer id, subscriptions, categorize, account type, search crash, debt goals, money parse)\n\nReview of changes since a36673b surfaced 7 confirmed bugs in the finance v1\nrewrite; all fixed with regression coverage:\n\n1. Transfer/transaction id collision — transfers (separate AUTOINCREMENT table)\n   surfaced in the txn list with a bare numeric id that could collide with a\n   fin_transactions id, so update/delete/categorize could hit the wrong row.\n   Namespace transfer ids as \"tr:<n>\" strings; UI gates edit controls to\n   numeric-id rows only.\n2. Subscriptions always empty — compute_overview read .get(\"recurring\") but\n   compute_recurring returns {items:[...]}. Read the right key.\n3. categorize_transactions false success — reported the requested category and\n   counted every row even when it silently fell back to \"uncategorized\". Now\n   reports the resolved count.\n4. Account-type mismatch — UI offered credit/investment but schema CHECK +\n   normalizer only allowed checking/savings/card/cash, silently coercing to\n   cash. Unified the vocabulary (checking/savings/credit/cash/investment; card\n   kept as a legacy alias) across schema, normalizer, agent tool, and UI.\n5. Transaction search crash — r.merchant.toLowerCase() threw on transfer rows\n   (no merchant). Guard with ?? \"\".\n6. Debt goals rendered NaN / \"0 / target\" — Dashboard used g.current\n   unconditionally, but debt goals carry owed/progress. Branch by kind, drive\n   the bar off the backend''s progress field.\n7. European money format imported as 0.00 — parse_money stripped commas,\n   leaving multi-dot strings that failed to parse. Detect the decimal separator\n   (handles 1.234,50 and 1,234.50).\n\nmock/finance.ts seeds a credit account + debt goal so dev:mock exercises the\ndebt branch and credit type. Verified in mock (dashboard, transactions search,\naccounts) and via 3 new finance tests (33 pass).","tree":{"sha":"aeede6ed0876e6d5ed8a1f0cf9f973d444319e48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/aeede6ed0876e6d5ed8a1f0cf9f973d444319e48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/8de860858481e44ab1854ab08f3d868fbd302da0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ