","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/da49d3208ec2f1bb14258e19ceefa5483781a212/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:19:55Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:19:55Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"chore: lock tempfile dev-dependency (finance tests)\n\nCargo.lock update from adding tempfile as a zanto-desktop dev-dependency for the\nW5 typed-storage tests (temp DataStore). Source already committed; this just locks\nthe dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"847efa0eaaa50bf47b450436f985038e46724269","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/847efa0eaaa50bf47b450436f985038e46724269"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/da49d3208ec2f1bb14258e19ceefa5483781a212","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/da49d3208ec2f1bb14258e19ceefa5483781a212","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKGRhNDlkMzIwOGVjMmYxYmIxNDI1OGUxOWNlZWZhNTQ4Mzc4MWEyMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c","sha":"4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c"}],"sha":"da49d3208ec2f1bb14258e19ceefa5483781a212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/da49d3208ec2f1bb14258e19ceefa5483781a212"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:05:46Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T20:05:46Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): real Import flow (was a stub) + subscription cadence fix\n\nThe Import tab was fully stubbed — a hardcoded sample statement that just pushed 2\nrows. In the live app the core ''drop a statement'' flow was fake. Wire it to the\nreal IPC path:\n\n- Choose a file (pickFiles) → finance_parse_statement (permission-checked, parses\n  CSV/xlsx/ods server-side, returns headers + preview + a suggested column mapping)\n  → real column mapping dropdowns (date/merchant/amount, pre-filled from the\n  suggestion; hint for separate debit/credit columns) + destination account picker\n  → real preview table → finance_import_statement (re-reads + imports server-side,\n  dedups, auto-categorizes via rules) → done state with real inserted/skipped/error\n  counts. Surfaces truncated/malformed warnings honestly (the data-loss the backend\n  already reports).\n- Mock handlers for finance_parse_statement/finance_import_statement so the flow\n  stays walkable in dev:mock.\n- Fix: subscriptions show ''/ month'' (real detect_recurring returns no ''cadence''\n  field; the detector is monthly-only) instead of a blank.\n\npnpm check 0/0; UI 37 pass (C-7 flake). Verified in mock: choose file → mapping +\npreview → Import → ''Imported & categorized ✓ — 5 transactions imported''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9faa2c1c9004619dc934233154f58fa72c1b460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/c9faa2c1c9004619dc934233154f58fa72c1b460"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDRiMWJlNTBlZmEzYTAwYmVjMmQ4YzYzZTg1YWMwMDE5NWZkNWMwM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f","sha":"3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f"}],"sha":"4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/4b1be50efa3a00bec2d8c63e85ac00195fd5c03c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:49:59Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:49:59Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): W1 — AI auto-categorization (agent-driven)\n\nThe last v1 piece: a fresh import / uncategorized rows are no longer a dead end.\nRather than thread an LLM client into the synchronous App handlers (a large,\ninvasive change to the trait all apps share), W1 uses the agent + W2''s tools — the\nLLM lives in the chat loop where it belongs, numbers stay deterministic:\n\n- The dashboard''s uncategorized nudge gains an ''Auto-categorize'' (sparkles) button\n  that asks the agent to list uncategorized rows (query_transactions), infer each\n  from its merchant CONSTRAINED to existing categories, bulk-apply via\n  categorize_transactions, and add_category_rule for confident merchants — so\n  future imports auto-apply (''correct once, rule forever'').\n- A start-action ''Auto-categorize my transactions'' does the same from a chip.\n- The app skill already directs the model to call the tools, not just explain.\n\nTradeoff (vs an in-import backend classify): categorization is an agent turn, not\ninstant-on-import — acceptable, far lower risk, and a backend classify can be\nlayered later without redoing this.\n\ncargo build green; pnpm check 0/0; UI 37 pass (C-7 flake). Verified in mock: the\nAuto-categorize button fires the categorize prompt into chat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f030869c8b94144c1dadb13b4bff009f44d5f620","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/f030869c8b94144c1dadb13b4bff009f44d5f620"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDNhMmQyNDAzY2QxNGU5MzE0NmRjMmVmMjA2OGUyMDU5OWE2M2JkNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b","sha":"96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b"}],"sha":"3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/3a2d2403cd14e93146dc2ef2068e20599a63bd4f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:39:02Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:39:02Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): go live — FinanceV1 on the real typed backend\n\nUn-gate the 4-tab FinanceV1 redesign from mock-only to the real app, now that the\nbackend supports it (W5 typed storage + W2 agent tools).\n\n- compute_overview emits the FinanceV1 fields additively (legacy keys kept for the\n  old Dashboard): currency (from profile), spent/net aliases, safe_to_spend (W3 —\n  income or monthly_income setting, minus spent, minus unspent budget; never\n  negative), a monthly income/spend/savings series for the stacked cashflow chart,\n  trend_months labels, category_breakdown for the donut, and subscriptions from the\n  recurring detector. Adds per-month income tracking.\n- action handler gains categorize_transactions (the UI bulk-recategorize path,\n  same handler as the agent tool); query handler gains categories (the picker\n  list). So FinanceV1''s edits + ''edit with AI'' icons hit real typed-SQL handlers.\n- Canvas renders FinanceV1 for the finance app (was the old Dashboard).\n\nThe agent (W2) now backs the ''edit with AI'' actions; manual edits go through the\nsame handlers. Every number is still deterministic Rust; the LLM only classifies/\nnarrates.\n\ncargo test -p zanto-desktop 49 pass (new overview-emits-FinanceV1-fields test);\npnpm check 0/0; UI suite 37 pass incl. the finance regressions (C-7 pre-existing\nflake).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6095057cd743670a211b2f387da25a1af90392df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/6095057cd743670a211b2f387da25a1af90392df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDk2YTg4N2Y2NTVjNTY1MzFlMWIwYzliYzBhN2RlMzEyMzEwNWE2NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe","sha":"b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe"}],"sha":"96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/96a887f655c56531e1b0c9bc0a7de3123105a66b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:33:07Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:33:07Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): W2 — agent tools so the AI can run the app\n\nThe chat agent could only add/query/update/delete transactions + transfers;\nbudgets, accounts, goals, and categorization were UI-only — so ''set a grocery\nbudget to 400'' or ''recategorize this'' couldn''t actually be done from chat (the\ndefining seam for an AI-native finance app, and what the prototype''s ''edit with\nAI'' icons need).\n\nAdd 5 agent tools wired through the existing typed-SQL handlers (no new\npersistence/math): set_budget (upsert one category''s limit), add_account,\nset_goal, add_category_rule (teach merchant→category), categorize_transactions\n(bulk-fix by id). Thin agent_* wrappers read current state, merge one item, and\ncall the existing save handlers, so single-item natural-language asks work. The\napp skill now tells the model to CALL these tools, not just explain.\n\nNew test exercises set_budget (upsert, no dup) / add_account / set_goal /\ncategorize via dispatch_tool — and incidentally confirmed the FK integrity is\nreal: replacing the account set can''t delete an account a goal references.\n\ncargo test -p zanto-desktop: 48 pass / 0 fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44d05610c45da1d8988d06fbfd294a004eb227ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/44d05610c45da1d8988d06fbfd294a004eb227ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKGIzNzJhMzhmMmE1NzgwY2M5YTJiYTM5NzJlYTYxMDA0ZGU0OTJjYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e","sha":"a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e"}],"sha":"b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/b372a38f2a5780cc9a2ba3972ea61004de492cbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:13:33Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:13:33Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): stacked monthly cashflow chart + category donut\n\nReplace the awkward per-category horizontal trend bars (which read poorly) with the\ntwo-card layout from the reference designs:\n- Cashflow — last 6 months: a STACKED monthly bar chart (income green / spend rose\n  / savings blue stacked per month). Click a bar → an overlay with that month''s\n  income/spend/saved + an ''Ask about <month>'' AI action.\n- This month by category: a category DONUT (conic-gradient) with the spent total in\n  the hole and a clickable legend; clicking a slice opens that category''s 6-month\n  drill.\n\nRemoved the now-redundant ''Spend, last 6 months'' insights card (the cashflow chart\nsupersedes it). Mock overview gains  (income/spend/savings per month) and\n. EditSheet gained footer/onClose for read-only drill panels.\n\npnpm check 0/0; UI 37 pass (C-7 flake). Verified in mock: stacked bars render\ncorrectly, donut + legend, both drills open. Mock-only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"431ee329467e0fa498d82dc86ddaf420cc233d03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/431ee329467e0fa498d82dc86ddaf420cc233d03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKGE5YzdjOGU5NWQyZjgyZjA5OWNhY2M4YmJjNzA2NDkyNDlhNDcwNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809","sha":"7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809"}],"sha":"a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/a9c7c8e95d2f82f099cacc8bbc70649249a4705e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:13:16Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T19:13:16Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): W5 complete — typed SQLite storage, no migration\n\nRewrite the finance storage layer from the schemaless JSON DataStore to the typed\nfin_* tables. Fresh schema only — no JSON→typed migration (no users yet, per scope\ndecision). The query/action JSON output shapes are preserved exactly; this is a\nstorage refactor that adds the FK/CHECK integrity the JSON store couldn''t enforce.\n\nKey design that de-risked it: aggregate.rs is UNTOUCHED. A load_txn_records helper\nSELECTs fin_transactions (joined to fin_categories for the name, fin_accounts for\nthe account) UNION fin_transfers and reconstructs each as a legacy-shaped Record\n({type,amount,category,date,merchant,account,...}; category_id NULL → ''uncategorized'';\ntransfers → type:''transfer''). Every compute_* feeds those Records to the unchanged\naggregate functions, so all the subtle business logic (recurring, forecast, trends,\nbudget pace, goal status, account balances) is byte-identical.\n\nAll writers/readers rewritten to typed SQL via DataStore::with_conn:\nadd/update/delete_transaction, save_accounts/budgets/goals/profile,\nsave/delete_category_rule, add_transfer, import_transactions (dedup now on the\nindexed fin_transactions.import_hash), and every get_*/compute_*.\n\nIntegrity improvements (the only allowed behavior changes): FK/CHECK enforced;\nsave_accounts won''t delete an account still referenced by a txn/transfer (vs the\nold silent overwrite) — matches the ''orphaned money not lost'' contract. Widgets\nremain the lone JSON store (out of typed scope). migrate_transactions is now a\nno-op.\n\ncargo build green, zero warnings. cargo test -p zanto-desktop: 47 pass / 0 fail —\nthe 28-test finance suite includes new FK-rejects-orphan, CHECK-rejects-bad-type,\nschema-seeds-defaults, full categorized round-trip, rules-resolve-on-add, and\nimport-dedupe tests, plus every preserved aggregate test. Independently verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"692ecd9546202ef311cd852bdc3d28793208fd86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/692ecd9546202ef311cd852bdc3d28793208fd86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDdkZGYzMTJmYzNlZjc1YTE1NGQxMDk3ZDk2YWVkODVmNDBmOGY4MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d","sha":"c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d"}],"sha":"7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/7ddf312fc3ef75a154d1097d96aed85f40f8f809"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:46:50Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:46:50Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): W5 foundation — DataStore.with_conn + fin_* typed schema\n\nStart of the real finance backend (W5: typed SQLite). Lay the foundation the\nhandler/aggregate rewrites build on:\n\n- core: DataStore::with_conn(closure) lends the existing WAL connection for raw\n  typed SQL (no second connection / lock contention); + a workspace() accessor.\n  Re-export rusqlite from zanto-core so downstream crates build typed SQL on the\n  same version without their own dep.\n- finance/schema.rs: idempotent fin_* DDL (categories tree, accounts,\n  transactions, transfers, budgets, goals, category_rules, import_profiles,\n  profile, meta) with FK + CHECK + indexes — the integrity the JSON store can''t\n  enforce — workspace-scoped. seed_default_categories + a fin_meta migration\n  marker. ensure_schema/seed are wired in W5.4 (handler rewrite).\n\nAlso fixes a UX bug flagged in review: the ''Spent'' KPI card was red with a\ndown-arrow, wrongly signalling spending as bad / a falling trend as alarming.\nSpending is a neutral fact — card is now neutral with a receipt icon; red is\nreserved for a genuinely negative net (over-budget alarm stays on the budget bars).\n\ncargo build green; core data tests pass; pnpm check 0/0. No behavior change yet\n(schema unused until W5.4); the prototype Spent fix is live in mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e40c8883174ae2ca77d51e78ee4d0ef363a9a4a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/e40c8883174ae2ca77d51e78ee4d0ef363a9a4a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKGMxZWI0MjliZTYzZmNlYjY3NzMzOTI1ZGNhY2RjZTllNTgwNTY0OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b","sha":"47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b"}],"sha":"c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/c1eb429be63fceb67733925dcacdce9e5805649d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:33:30Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T18:33:30Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): dashboard refinements — currency setting, trends, colors, hide\n\nFour UX refinements to the v1 finance dashboard prototype (from reference designs):\n\n1. Currency is a SETTING threaded everywhere, not hardcoded USD — the whole view\n   formats with overview.currency (mock defaults to AED + a save_profile path to\n   change it), proving it''s not USD-locked. Single-currency display.\n2. Top categories → per-category 6-month trend mini-bars (how each is trending,\n   current month highlighted) with click-to-drill into an overlay showing the\n   category''s larger 6-month chart + an ''Ask about <category>'' AI action.\n3. Semantic KPI card colors: Spent rose/red, Income green, Net green-or-red by\n   sign, Net worth neutral — meaning at a glance.\n4. Net + Net worth masked (••••) behind an eye reveal toggle.\n\nAlso: fixed the uncategorized-nudge grammar (1 needs / N need), added EditSheet\nfooter/onClose props for read-only overlay panels, fixed the drill chart overflow\nin the 360px sheet.\n\nUpdates regression-finance R-6 to exact-case ''Dining'' (the FinanceV1 dashboard now\nalso lists categories in the canvas; the chat block uses verbatim ''Dining'' vs the\ndashboard''s CSS-capitalized ''dining''). Mock-only; no Rust change.\n\nAlso commits the W5 typed-storage spec (docs/specs) — awaiting approval before\nbackend implementation.\n\npnpm check 0/0; UI 37 pass (C-7 pre-existing flake). All four refinements verified\nin mock: AED everywhere, trend bars + drill, semantic colors, eye reveal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d7248973041d818930d7887becde4ee385ae6c7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/d7248973041d818930d7887becde4ee385ae6c7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDQ3ZmJjMDBjMDAzOWRiODhlZmZkYzFlZDBlNTljN2FlZjA3OTgzOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9","sha":"2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9"}],"sha":"47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/47fbc00c0039db88effdc1ed0e59c7aef079838b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:49:32Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T17:49:32Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(finance): v1 redesign prototype — 4-tab UI (mock-gated) + plan\n\nThe finance app today is an 8-tab control panel that imports statements but leaves\neverything uncategorized (proven by a first-hand end-to-end run: 14/14 rows\nuncategorized on a clean statement, no safe-to-spend answer). This adds the\nvalidated v1 redesign as a clickable prototype + the PM plan behind it.\n\nPrototype (FinanceV1 + v1/{Dashboard,Transactions,Accounts,Import}Tab + EditSheet +\nAiEditButton), backed by a stateful mock (mock/finance.ts):\n- 4 clear tabs (Dashboard | Transactions | Accounts | Import) replacing 8 + an\n  Edit/widget-builder config mode.\n- Dashboard leads with a ''Safe to spend'' number, KPI cards, top categories,\n  budget/goal bars (info, not guilt), insights (spend + subscriptions), a gentle\n  uncategorized nudge.\n- Dual-path edit model: clean read views; an ''Edit'' toggle per multi-edit view;\n  edits open in an overlay side-panel (EditSheet); every manual control is paired\n  with a small ''edit with AI'' icon that fires a context prompt into chat\n  (verified end-to-end: the AI icon sends e.g. ''Recategorize the X transaction\n  and similar ones'').\n- Import shows map → preview → ''N rows auto-categorized'' → honest\n  ''0 skipped, 0 malformed'' trust surface.\n\nGated to Vite mode ''mock'' in Canvas.svelte — the real app keeps the current\nDashboard until the real backend (typed SQLite schema, agent tools,\nauto-categorization) returns these shapes. Mock-only; no Rust change.\n\ndocs/product/finance-v1-plan.md: the full review, gap analysis (audit × cited\nresearch), goal, plan (W0–W5), and the v1 SQLite schema.\n\npnpm check 0/0. Prototype walked in mock and judged satisfactory.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a18de25613167f4497069fa05f3c053326b1c4f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/a18de25613167f4497069fa05f3c053326b1c4f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDJlYzYzMWQzYWU4YzYwNzU5ZDU5MmQ5ZmY5ZjFiN2ZjY2Y5YzhlYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/383443dcbd6aa3940a74091e1bae20687a9ea352","sha":"383443dcbd6aa3940a74091e1bae20687a9ea352","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/383443dcbd6aa3940a74091e1bae20687a9ea352"}],"sha":"2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/2ec631d3ae8c60759d592d9ff9f1b7fccf9c8ea9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/383443dcbd6aa3940a74091e1bae20687a9ea352/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:01:36Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T20:01:36Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"fix(token-counter): accumulate sent_chars across tool iterations in estimate\n\nThe chars/4 estimate fallback (providers that report no usage, e.g. Ollama)\nOVERWROTE sent_chars each tool-loop iteration (last prompt only) while answer_chars\naccumulated — so the estimate''s prompt half covered one iteration and the\ncompletion half the whole turn, inconsistent with the provider path which sums\nprompt_tokens across iterations. Change sent_chars to += so both halves cover the\nwhole turn. Strengthened the unit test to assert the multi-iteration arithmetic\n(two 40-char prompts → 80/4=20 prompt tokens, not 10).\n\ncargo test core 136 green (incl. the extended estimate test).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"422a2c62730304a5ae784a9f5738aa32c4805c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/422a2c62730304a5ae784a9f5738aa32c4805c65"},"url"