ed{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/3701f19be21cc3a7a8f53a4e65889d375d18376a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:55:23Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:55:23Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(chat): persistent tail loader for the whole busy turn\n\nThe bouncing-dots row in MessageList was a pre-content placeholder only — it\nvanished the moment the live turn produced any segment, leaving long streams and\ntool-loop gaps with no thread-level ''working'' cue. Show it for the entire busy\nturn instead, with the label switching ''thinking'' → ''responding…'' once content\nlands. It stays low-key (tail dots) so it complements, not duplicates, the\nThinkingBlock''s inline spinner; reduced-motion is already neutralized globally in\napp.css.\n\nUI-only, one component. pnpm check 0/0; UI suite 37 pass (C-7 pre-existing flake,\nconfirmed identical on clean HEAD). Verified in mock: ''responding…'' persists with\nstreamed content present and a parked turn; Stop clears it and shows ''Stopped''.\n\nFeature #2 shipped; spec archived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8045091712e4b3586a6043b3852218926fbefa12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/8045091712e4b3586a6043b3852218926fbefa12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/3701f19be21cc3a7a8f53a4e65889d375d18376a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/3701f19be21cc3a7a8f53a4e65889d375d18376a","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDM3MDFmMTliZTIxY2MzYTdhOGY1M2E0ZTY1ODg5ZDM3NWQxODM3NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/e924460f5b1d2f91847a11ebbd303c0d7503bb42","sha":"e924460f5b1d2f91847a11ebbd303c0d7503bb42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/e924460f5b1d2f91847a11ebbd303c0d7503bb42"}],"sha":"3701f19be21cc3a7a8f53a4e65889d375d18376a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/3701f19be21cc3a7a8f53a4e65889d375d18376a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/e924460f5b1d2f91847a11ebbd303c0d7503bb42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:39:32Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:39:32Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(token-counter): session total + context-window gauge (phase 2)\n\nComplete the token counter. Carry the active model''s context window on the\nchat_done event (window_tokens, computed once before the policy match so it''s\nthe same number whether Auto or Summarize is active) and surface a compact\nsession gauge in the composer meta-row: a thin bar + ''used / window'' (e.g.\n2.5k / 8.2k), ''~''-prefixed when any contributing turn was estimated, turning\nred past 90%. The session total is a $derived sum over the loaded conversation''s\nassistant usage (exported as a function — Svelte forbids exporting derived state\nfrom a module); windowTokens lives on the store, reset on session switch.\n\ncargo: core 131 green, desktop builds + tests pass; pnpm check 0/0; UI suite\n37 pass (C-7 pre-existing flake). Verified in mock: gauge shows 1.2k / 8.2k after\none turn, accumulates to 2.5k / 8.2k after two.\n\nFeature #1 fully shipped; spec archived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"629d521d9057023d2a4f4e8c2fbac7b1bb44c286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/629d521d9057023d2a4f4e8c2fbac7b1bb44c286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r