owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/59b7a7b1f372dcf2b130fede4db40032cf37d07b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:27:49Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-29T14:27:49Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(token-counter): capture LLM token usage + per-message label (phase 1)\n\nCapture genai captured_usage on the stream End event in zanto-core chat(),\nsumming across tool-loop iterations; fall back to a chars/4 estimate (flagged\n~estimated) when the provider reports none (e.g. Ollama). Thread it through:\n- core: TurnUsage struct + ChatTurn.usage; persisted via assistant_turn_meta\n  (signature + 4 callsites + tests updated; new aggregator unit test).\n- desktop: TauriSink.finish(usage) emits a { usage } chat_done payload (single\n  emitter, at ipc/chat.rs:290 after chat() returns); RenderMsg.usage parsed in\n  from_meta so reloaded sessions keep the count.\n- frontend: TokenUsage type, onChatDone payload, ChatEntry.usage stored from the\n  event + mapped in toEntries; a per-message ''N tokens'' / ''~N tokens'' label by\n  the Copy button with a prompt/completion tooltip.\n\nPhase 2 (session total + context gauge) deferred. Spec corrected to match the\nreal persistence path (assistant_turn_meta in core, not ipc/chat.rs).\n\ncargo test 131 (core) green; pnpm check 0/0; UI suite 37 pass (C-7 pre-existing\nflake unrelated); verified the label renders in mock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37bce91561e8ccad106513204b36167a5f21b4a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/37bce91561e8ccad106513204b36167a5f21b4a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/59b7a7b1f372dcf2b130fede4db40032cf37d07b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/59b7a7b1f372dcf2b130fede4db40032cf37d07b","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDU5YjdhN2IxZjM3MmRjZjJiMTMwZmVkZTRkYjQwMDMyY2YzN2QwN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/0931f513