v/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/5974b8c74cd61ede396cbacbc637687f1f7e96b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T17:59:02Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T17:59:02Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"ci(release): build Linux on ubuntu-24.04, ship .deb/.rpm/AppImage, fix macOS notes\n\nThe AppImage bundled an old WebKit (ubuntu-22.04, ~2.36) that fails EGL init on\nmodern Mesa/GPU stacks → blank window on rolling distros. Build Linux on\nubuntu-24.04 instead (WebKit ~2.44) so the bundled WebKit is recent enough to\nrender. Also plumb the already-built .rpm through the workflow (it was dropped by\nthe upload glob + find filter + had no rename case), so Linux now ships .deb\n(Ubuntu/Debian), .rpm (Fedora), and AppImage (Arch/portable).\n\nRewrite release notes: macOS right-click→Open no longer works on macOS 15 —\ndocument System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway and the xattr\nquarantine-removal. Notarization deferred (Apple paid membership not active).\n\nTradeoff: 24.04 base sets a glibc >= 2.39 floor (current distros only).\nWorkflow-only; YAML + run-block bash validated; cargo build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e27b6d53c402d080ceba241e6ae878554a4ab5b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/e27b6d53c402d080ceba241e6ae878554a4ab5b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/5974b8c74cd61ede396cbacbc637687f1f7e96b9","verification":{"payload":null,