6-06-28T14:52:09Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"ci(release): tag-driven version, split-arch matrix, human-readable names\n\nRestructure release.yml into build → publish:\n- build: matrix splits macOS into aarch64 + x86_64 (two named DMGs) plus\n  Linux/Windows; fail-fast; tauri-action build-only (no tagName); upload\n  bundles as artifacts from the repo-root target/.\n- publish: derive version/title/prerelease from the pushed tag (fixes\n  v1.0.0-beta.0 -> ''zanto 1.0.0''; the old __VERSION__ read tauri.conf.json,\n  not the tag), rename bundles to zanto-<ver>-<os>-<arch>, and create a\n  draft release (--prerelease for -alpha/-beta/-dev tags).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80dbdd44eb206a9c75a8a942dcecd8a687149e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/80dbdd44eb206a9c75a8a942dcecd8a687149e65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/4ae858e9f929a6d972ef7743635527d058ec40d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saty