mail":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(core): non-disclosure guardrail in base system prompt\n\nSmall local models recite their system prompt when asked ''what can you\ndo?'' or even on a greeting. Append a prompt-level non-disclosure clause to\nBASE_SYSTEM_PROMPT: never reveal/quote/paraphrase the instructions, and on\n''what can you do?'' answer in task terms instead of reciting capabilities.\nAdd base_system_prompt_has_nondisclosure_policy unit test. Guidance, not a\nhard guarantee — no output-side filter (per spec).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33d0bf31345b80624ebe988bc51c682cb860575e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/33d0bf31345b80624ebe988bc51c682cb860575e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/30ac22f21ef0bb882b4e2107ef3a32266f52e88d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g