.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/a4ee233d013f3bc3ad70c0647adbfc43b0921996/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T20:03:33Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T20:03:33Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"feat(desktop): two-pane settings dialog with provider + theme cards\n\nRedesign the Settings dialog from a single scrolling column into a two-pane\nshell (left grouped nav + right content pane), per the Orbit reference mockup.\n\n- Left nav: grouped MODELS/APP items with Lucide icons, active highlight,\n  pinned Close + esc hint. ''Settings'' title moves to the nav.\n- Right pane shows only the active section, each with a title + description.\n- Providers: registry rendered as selectable cards (deterministic avatar tint,\n  endpoint, soft-tonal Active pill) replacing the dropdown; Configure block\n  (model/endpoint/key/overrides/Save) unchanged below.\n- Theme: Paper/Midnight swatch cards previewing the palette, replacing the\n  Light/Dark buttons; density segmented control kept.\n- Folder access, Context, Generation, Skill move verbatim into nav panes.\n\nPresentational only — every ipc/appStore call, the seed $effect, and all\nform logic are byte-identical (verified: no IPC/handler call-shape drift).\nVerified both themes via mock: cards render with Active pill, selection flips\nprovider + theme live, density works. pnpm check 0/0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c63a6edb3ede0619cef8fb9972c149b4a6d74aee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/tre