ts/e4db59b67e5ebca2e5a018b57a01d2684887d53e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T19:42:22Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T19:42:22Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"style(desktop): mute the user chat bubble to blend with the background\n\nThe solid bg-primary (violet) user bubble read as a loud accent. Switch it to\nbg-muted + text-foreground so it sits just above the page background,\ndistinguished by shape/shadow rather than saturation — quieter, matching the\nreceding-chrome direction.\n\n- Bubble: bg-primary/text-primary-foreground → bg-muted/text-foreground\n- Attachment chips: primary-foreground tints → neutral border + bg-background/50\n- Revert the now-unneeded primary-foreground prose/link overrides (text is\n  normal foreground on muted again)\n- User-bubble inline code drops onto var(--background) so it stays visible\n  against the muted bubble (avoids muted-on-muted)\n\nVerified both themes: bubble sits above page bg, text + inline code legible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ae7090b6401721c449fc0e41e644bd0f128cfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/5ae7090b6401721c449fc0e41e644bd0f128cfe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/e4db59b67e5ebca2e5a018b57a01d2684887d53e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login"