achments).\nDoc-attachment paths (@token) are not covered — only separately-threaded\nimage_paths are persisted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7851eaca95c11efad77f2183523c4620ece26fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/7851eaca95c11efad77f2183523c4620ece26fb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/56a4c8c20f5525901bc8c801c7bdc861e461ddb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/56a4c8c20f5525901bc8c801c7bdc861e461ddb3","node_id":"C_kwDOS2ISZtoAKDU2YTRjOGMyMGY1NTI1OTAxYmM4YzgwMWM3YmRjODYxZTQ2MWRkYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commit/cbe60c6ec1f5cb3cd48a2a2243228484be45186e","sha":"cbe60c6ec1f5cb3cd48a2a2243228484be45186e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/cbe60c6ec1f5cb3cd48a2a2243228484be45186e"}],"sha":"56a4c8c20f5525901bc8c801c7bdc861e461ddb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/56a4c8c20f5525901bc8c801c7bdc861e461ddb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/commits/cbe60c6ec1f5cb3cd48a2a2243228484be45186e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T23:36:21Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T23:36:21Z","email":"satyamyadav3@gmail.com","name":"Satyam"},"message":"fix(desktop/ui): Batch C review fixes — skill menu /-hijack + filter, HITL step focus, async clear/loadDir\n\nFix 1: move menu===\"skill\" guard before slash regex in syncMenu so typing while\nthe skill picker is open doesn''t call openSlashMenu() and destroy it.\n\nFix 2: introduce skillQuery state reset in openSkillMenu; syncMenu updates\nskillQuery from the trailing line fragment (not the full input); filteredSkills\nuses skillQuery so prior composer content can''t pollute the filter.\n\nFix 3: after stepIdx mutation in Enter handler, Next button, and Back button,\ncall await tick(); focusFirst() to move keyboard focus to the new step''s first\nfield.\n\nFix 4: make clearActiveSkill async and symmetric — await ipc.setActiveSkill(null)\nbefore clearing activeSkillName; surface error on failure without losing the chip.\n\nFix 5: add a loadSeq counter to loadDir so out-of-order responses from rapid\ndirectory changes don''t overwrite entries; void-call loadDir in the $effect.\n\nTests: C-skill-filter proves Fix 1 + 2 (filter narrows skills, picker survives\ntyping). H-focus and H-focus-back prove Fix 3 (step-2 field focused after Enter\nand Back respectively).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36b95164e8e07b22495ba318bc85befed94dc937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/trees/36b95164e8e07b22495ba318bc85befed94dc937"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/satyamyadav/zanto-rust/git/commits/cbe60c6ec1f5cb3cd48a2a2243228484be45186e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3583587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/satyamyadav","id":3583587,"login":"satyamyadav","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1ODM1ODc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satyamyadav/subscri