18:03:01Z","email":"zgrasso1324@gmail.com","name":"Zack Grasso"},"message":"Enhance momants-conversation-stats with new features and configurations.\n\n- Updated .env.example to include new environment variables for Redis, scheduling, and Hugging Face models.\n- Modified docker-compose.yml to add Redis and Gotenberg services, and adjusted API service configurations.\n- Expanded README.md with architecture details, quick start instructions, and service descriptions.\n- Improved backend Dockerfile to include additional scripts and configurations.\n- Updated requirements.txt to include new dependencies for enhanced functionality.\n- Refactored backend code to support new features, including improved health checks, caching mechanisms, and conversation management.\n- Added new API endpoints for managing conversations and insights, including deletion and review functionalities.\n\nThis commit lays the groundwork for a more robust and feature-rich application.","tree":{"sha":"bf01db0a2e60fcda3ec9368370f8d6bf736e00d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zack-Grasso/momants-conversation-stats/git/trees/bf01db0a2e60fcda3ec9368370f8d6bf736e00d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Zack-Grasso/momants-conversation-stats/git/commits/6acb7447f12d55ceaed7ef95e1fa5442b526c7e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223637126?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackgrasso-ai/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackgrasso-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackgrasso-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackgrasso-ai/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zackgrasso-ai","id":223637126,"login":"zackgrasso-ai","node_id":"U_kgDODVRuhg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zackgrasso-ai/orgs","received_events_url":"https: